('1728bc40-bddf-53df-af5a-57f1252d192b','51306f41-4aff-51fc-b99b-41bf2a052bcc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','having a strong desire to do something, so that you will not let anyone stop you',null,null,'مصمم، با اراده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Gwen is a very determined woman.","translation":"گوئن زنی بسیار مصمم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821449.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was determined to win.","translation":"او مصمم به پیروزی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821452.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was determined that the same mistakes would not be repeated.","translation":"او مصمم بود که همان اشتباهات تکرار نشود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821455.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('75f11548-668c-5448-8004-31e37dc19210','51306f41-4aff-51fc-b99b-41bf2a052bcc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','showing determination , especially in a difficult situation',null,null,'نشان دادن عزم، به ویژه در شرایط دشوار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was making a determined effort to give up smoking.","translation":"او تلاش جدی برای ترک سیگار انجام می داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001716317.mp3"},{"sentence":"The library was closed down despite determined opposition .","translation":"کتابخانه با وجود مخالفت مصمم بسته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000821461.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('24acf813-dad4-5108-a001-fd2cc832c867','1cd3df11-bfc8-5290-a0c2-7296413ae01b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a way in which two or more people or things are not like each other','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تفاوت، فرق؛ اختلاف؛ باقی‌مانده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/major/huge difference I think you’ll notice a big difference.','an important/significant/crucial difference A study of the two groups of students showed a significant difference.','a slight/small/minor difference There’s only a slight difference between the male and the female bird.','a marked/dramatic difference (= very noticeable ) There was a marked difference between the two sets of results.','a subtle difference (= not obvious ) There’s a subtle difference in flavour between these coffees.','an essential/fundamental difference (= a very basic one ) The fundamental differences between the two sides slowly emerged.','cultural/political/regional etc differences the major cultural differences between the west and the east','class differences (= between different classes of society ) People’s answers to the questions showed clear class differences.','sex/gender differences (= between men and women ) gender differences in levels of criminality','individual differences (= between one person and another ) We respect the children’s individual differences.','show a difference Our data showed considerable national differences.','know the difference (= know how two things are different ) If you don’t know the difference between two words, your dictionary can help.','can tell/see the difference (= can recognize how two things are different ) I can’t really see the difference between these two colours.','notice a difference She has noticed a dramatic difference in her energy levels.','spot the difference (= see the difference ) It’s easy to spot the difference between real and imitation leather.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There’s a big difference between knowing that something is true, and being able to prove it.","translation":"تفاوت زیادی بین دانستن اینکه چیزی درست است و توانایی اثبات آن وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689752.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is very little difference between the parties on green issues.","translation":"در مسائل سبز تفاوت بسیار کمی بین احزاب وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001962035.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do children know the difference between right and wrong?","translation":"آیا کودکان تفاوت بین درست و غلط را می دانند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823456.mp3"},{"sentence":"Researchers found a number of important differences in the way boys and girls learn.","translation":"محققان چندین تفاوت مهم در نحوه یادگیری پسران و دختران یافتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689755.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s a world of difference (= there’s a very big difference ) between being alone and being lonely.","translation":"دنیایی از تفاوت (= تفاوت بسیار بزرگ) بین تنها بودن و تنها بودن وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000458.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d11615d8-5718-5fb5-9f73-33ae44ac37fd','1cd3df11-bfc8-5290-a0c2-7296413ae01b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the amount by which one thing is greater or smaller than another','[ singular, uncountable ]','split the difference','مقداری که یک چیز بزرگتر یا کوچکتر از چیز دیگر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/major/huge difference I think you’ll notice a big difference.','an important/significant/crucial difference A study of the two groups of students showed a significant difference.','a slight/small/minor difference There’s only a slight difference between the male and the female bird.','a marked/dramatic difference (= very noticeable ) There was a marked difference between the two sets of results.','a subtle difference (= not obvious ) There’s a subtle difference in flavour between these coffees.','an essential/fundamental difference (= a very basic one ) The fundamental differences between the two sides slowly emerged.','cultural/political/regional etc differences the major cultural differences between the west and the east','class differences (= between different classes of society ) People’s answers to the questions showed clear class differences.','sex/gender differences (= between men and women ) gender differences in levels of criminality','individual differences (= between one person and another ) We respect the children’s individual differences.','show a difference Our data showed considerable national differences.','know the difference (= know how two things are different ) If you don’t know the difference between two words, your dictionary can help.','can tell/see the difference (= can recognize how two things are different ) I can’t really see the difference between these two colours.','notice a difference She has noticed a dramatic difference in her energy levels.','spot the difference (= see the difference ) It’s easy to spot the difference between real and imitation leather.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There’s not much difference in price.","translation":"تفاوت زیادی در قیمت وجود ندارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823452.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s a five-hour time difference between London and New York.","translation":"بین لندن و نیویورک پنج ساعت اختلاف زمانی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689761.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f94d361d-a5c9-559b-97a3-8924ecf8c628','1cd3df11-bfc8-5290-a0c2-7296413ae01b',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'make a/the difference','تفاوت، فرق؛ اختلاف؛ باقی‌مانده','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/major/huge difference I think you’ll notice a big difference.','an important/significant/crucial difference A study of the two groups of students showed a significant difference.','a slight/small/minor difference There’s only a slight difference between the male and the female bird.','a marked/dramatic difference (= very noticeable ) There was a marked difference between the two sets of results.','a subtle difference (= not obvious ) There’s a subtle difference in flavour between these coffees.','an essential/fundamental difference (= a very basic one ) The fundamental differences between the two sides slowly emerged.','cultural/political/regional etc differences the major cultural differences between the west and the east','class differences (= between different classes of society ) People’s answers to the questions showed clear class differences.','sex/gender differences (= between men and women ) gender differences in levels of criminality','individual differences (= between one person and another ) We respect the children’s individual differences.','show a difference Our data showed considerable national differences.','know the difference (= know how two things are different ) If you don’t know the difference between two words, your dictionary can help.','can tell/see the difference (= can recognize how two things are different ) I can’t really see the difference between these two colours.','notice a difference She has noticed a dramatic difference in her energy levels.','spot the difference (= see the difference ) It’s easy to spot the difference between real and imitation leather.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
