('fc2421a0-4cf7-529e-befe-c3e5fc78831e','0a9bbd81-c333-5a8e-8eb3-963c51a2bc5b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you have difficulty doing something, it is difficult for you to do','[ uncountable ]',null,'دشواری، سختی؛ مشکلات (مالی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They had great difficulty in finding a replacement.","translation":"آنها در یافتن جایگزین با مشکل زیادی روبرو بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823642.mp3"},{"sentence":"He got to his feet with difficulty.","translation":"به سختی روی پاهایش ایستاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823645.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f18dae2c-ca9d-596a-a093-fb3c61046c95','0a9bbd81-c333-5a8e-8eb3-963c51a2bc5b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a problem or something that causes trouble','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'مشکل یا چیزی که باعث دردسر می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have difficulties By the age of eight, Robbie was having difficulties at school.','run into/get into difficulties (= find yourself in a difficult situation ) Three people were rescued from a boat that had got into difficulties.','experience/encounter difficulties formal (= have difficulties ) Graduates often experience considerable difficulties in getting their first job.','face difficulties The hotel’s owners were facing financial difficulties.','overcome/resolve difficulties (= deal with them successfully ) We are confident that we can overcome these difficulties.','present/pose difficulties formal (= be something that is difficult to deal with ) English spelling may present some difficulties for learners.','be fraught with difficulties (= involve a lot of them ) The whole plan was fraught with difficulties.','cause/lead to difficulties Stress and worry both cause sleep difficulties.','give rise to difficulties formal (= cause them ) The stormy weather gave rise to difficulties for many of the competitors in the yacht race.','difficulties arise (= happen ) It’s best to discuss any difficulties that arise rather than trying to deal with them alone.','major/serious/severe difficulties By then, we were having serious financial difficulties.','considerable difficulties (= a lot of problems ) They had considerable difficulties in getting funding for their research.','technical difficulties The flight was delayed due to technical difficulties.','practical difficulties (= problems with doing something ) It’s a great idea, but there will be a number of practical difficulties.','financial/economic difficulties The company is facing serious financial difficulties.','breathing difficulties She was taken to hospital with breathing difficulties.','marital difficulties (= in a marriage ) You may need help in dealing with your marital difficulties.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are several difficulties with this theory.","translation":"این نظریه چندین مشکل دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007611.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you have any difficulties, give me a call.","translation":"اگر مشکلی دارید با من تماس بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007612.mp3"},{"sentence":"The project soon ran into difficulties.","translation":"این پروژه خیلی زود با مشکلاتی روبرو شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007618.mp3"},{"sentence":"Difficulties can arise when there is more than one defendant.","translation":"وقتی بیش از یک متهم وجود داشته باشد، ممکن است مشکلات ایجاد شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002007622.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4013dd74-38b4-5603-819c-7e53b5a9d40f','0a9bbd81-c333-5a8e-8eb3-963c51a2bc5b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if you are in difficulty, you are in a situation in which you have problems','[ uncountable ]',null,'اگر در سختی هستید، در شرایطی هستید که در آن مشکل دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The business is in financial difficulty.","translation":"کسب و کار در مشکلات مالی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823649.mp3"},{"sentence":"She soon got into difficulty with debt.","translation":"او خیلی زود با بدهی به مشکل خورد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823653.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b6136b16-a414-5732-a41d-d8d5354a27f1','0a9bbd81-c333-5a8e-8eb3-963c51a2bc5b',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the quality of being difficult to do','[ uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت سخت بودن انجام دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the difficulty of solving such problems","translation":"دشواری حل چنین مشکلاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001689847.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('61cc22ba-2455-5a77-807b-5706c4485d6f','0a9bbd81-c333-5a8e-8eb3-963c51a2bc5b',5,null,null,'spoken & written','how difficult something is','[ uncountable ]',null,'چقدر چیزی سخت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The tests vary in difficulty.","translation":"سختی آزمون ها متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000823663.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('160ed7a8-e023-553e-9f52-6eb5a23fe7fb','099ef913-ba99-56f5-9095-b9486a678bf5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to make someone feel unhappy because something they hoped for did not happen or was not as good as they expected',null,null,'ناامید کردن؛ از خجالت درآوردن (ناخواسته)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I hated to disappoint her.","translation":"از اینکه ناامیدش کنم متنفر بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001703776.mp3"},{"sentence":"Great things were expected of this band, and they didn’t disappoint.","translation":"چیزهای بزرگی از این گروه انتظار می رفت و آنها ناامید نشدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000826890.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
