('ebdbf865-9887-539d-bc0f-bbe7ef4e590c','fd8c4580-4198-513d-b79b-099d8bfded16',1,'knowledge/skill','دانش/مهارت','spoken & written','knowledge or skill that you gain from doing a job or activity, or the process of doing this','[ uncountable ]',null,'تجربه، چیرگی؛ اتفاق، رویداد (شخصی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have experience Applicants must have experience of working with children.','get/gain experience He suggested that I should gain some experience in a related industry like travel.','lack experience (= not have enough experience ) Some students lack experience writing essays.','broaden/widen your experience (= increase the amount of different experience you have ) After six years with the bank, he went to work in New York to broaden his experience.','considerable experience (= a lot of experience ) Margaret has considerable experience of hospital work.','long experience (= experience gained over a long period of time ) New prison officers are partnered by officers with long experience of dealing with violent prisoners.','useful/valuable experience (= useful experience ) That summer he got some valuable experience working in a tax office.','invaluable experience (= extremely useful experience ) Playing in the under-21 squad gives these young players invaluable experience.','relevant experience (= experience that directly relates to a job, subject, or problem ) Applicants need a degree and two years of relevant experience.','past/previous experience His only previous experience of broadcasting consisted of a job hosting a local radio station.','practical experience (= experience gained from doing something, not from books or study ) The classes provide students with some practical experience of computers.','first-hand experience (= experience gained by doing something yourself ) She has no first-hand experience of running a school.','a wealth of experience (= a lot of useful experience ) Between them, the management team have a wealth of experience.','lack of experience My colleagues kept making comments about about my lack of experience.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"You’ve got a lot of experience of lecturing.","translation":"شما تجربه زیادی از سخنرانی دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233268.mp3"},{"sentence":"my experience in many areas of the music business","translation":"تجربه من در بسیاری از زمینه های تجارت موسیقی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653803.mp3"},{"sentence":"He had no previous experience of managing a farm.","translation":"او هیچ تجربه قبلی در مدیریت مزرعه نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653804.mp3"},{"sentence":"The advice in the booklet reflects the practical experience we have gained (= experience gained by actually doing something, rather than knowledge from books etc ) .","translation":"توصیه های موجود در کتابچه منعکس کننده تجربه عملی است که ما به دست آورده ایم (= تجربه به دست آمده با انجام واقعی کاری، به جای دانش از کتاب ها و غیره).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653808.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had some experience in fashion design.","translation":"من تجربه ای در طراحی مد داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653812.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was turned down on the grounds of lack of experience .","translation":"او به دلیل نداشتن تجربه رد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653818.mp3"},{"sentence":"I have first-hand experience (= experience gained by doing something myself ) of running a school.","translation":"من تجربه دست اولی (= تجربه ای که با انجام کاری خودم به دست می آید) از اداره مدرسه دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653822.mp3"},{"sentence":"The programme enables pupils to gain some experience of the world of work.","translation":"این برنامه دانش آموزان را قادر می سازد تا برخی از تجربه های دنیای کار را به دست آورند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('79ace8f4-ee2b-5580-b047-0d42aa2f147b','fd8c4580-4198-513d-b79b-099d8bfded16',2,'knowledge of life','دانش زندگی','spoken & written','knowledge that you gain about life and the world by being in different situations and meeting different people, or the process of gaining this','[ uncountable ]',null,'دانشی که در مورد زندگی و دنیا با قرار گرفتن در موقعیت های مختلف و ملاقات با افراد مختلف و یا روند به دست آوردن آن به دست می آورید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"In his experience, women did not like getting their feet wet and muddy.","translation":"در تجربه او، زنان دوست نداشتند پاهای خود را خیس و گل آلود کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653829.mp3"},{"sentence":"Being a parent isn’t easy, as I know from experience.","translation":"همانطور که از تجربه می دانم، پدر و مادر بودن کار آسانی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653832.mp3"},{"sentence":"All animals appear to have some capacity to learn from experience.","translation":"به نظر می رسد که همه حیوانات ظرفیتی برای یادگیری از تجربه دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653833.mp3"},{"sentence":"I speak from bitter experience (= having learnt something because something unpleasant happened ) .","translation":"من از تجربه تلخ صحبت می کنم (= چیزی یاد گرفتم چون اتفاق ناخوشایندی افتاده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653834.mp3"},{"sentence":"From personal experience, she knew and understood the problems of alcohol addiction.","translation":"از تجربه شخصی، او مشکلات اعتیاد به الکل را می دانست و درک می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233303.mp3"},{"sentence":"Beth’s experience suggests that people don’t really change deep down.","translation":"تجربه بث نشان می دهد که مردم واقعاً در عمق خود تغییر نمی کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233313.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('26fa6a54-be3b-5283-9c8d-66e0b15ad144','fd8c4580-4198-513d-b79b-099d8bfded16',3,'something that happens','چیزی که اتفاق می افتد','spoken & written','something that happens to you or something you do, especially when this has an effect on what you feel or think','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که برای شما اتفاق می افتد یا کاری که انجام می دهید، به خصوص زمانی که این روی احساس یا فکر شما تأثیر می گذارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"childhood experiences","translation":"تجربیات دوران کودکی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233319.mp3"},{"sentence":"This was my first experience of living with other people.","translation":"این اولین تجربه من از زندگی با افراد دیگر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233322.mp3"},{"sentence":"Failing an exam was a new experience for me.","translation":"رد شدن در امتحان برای من تجربه جدیدی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233325.mp3"},{"sentence":"I had a similar experience last year.","translation":"من سال گذشته تجربه مشابهی داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653840.mp3"},{"sentence":"The two children in this story have been through a lot of bad experiences .","translation":"دو کودک در این داستان تجربه های بد زیادی را پشت سر گذاشته اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653846.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parachuting is quite an experience.","translation":"چتربازی یک تجربه کاملاً است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653850.mp3"},{"sentence":"This romantic evening cruise is a memorable experience.","translation":"این سفر دریایی عاشقانه عصرانه یک تجربه به یاد ماندنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233331.mp3"},{"sentence":"This kind of religious experience was a sign of God’s special favour.","translation":"این نوع تجربه دینی نشانه لطف خاص خداوند بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233339.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
('82110b61-7423-5ccd-9128-3bf037050571','fd8c4580-4198-513d-b79b-099d8bfded16',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the black/female/Russian etc experience','تجربه، چیرگی؛ اتفاق، رویداد (شخصی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ddf13f25-c3ec-5555-bd78-dfae335ff4f5','fd8c4580-4198-513d-b79b-099d8bfded16',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'work experience','تجربه، چیرگی؛ اتفاق، رویداد (شخصی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('a8e68c2e-c1c4-5df2-a20b-e263e0599908','638f046f-76ee-5490-a654-cab54bfb46a7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you experience a problem, event, or situation, it happens to you or affects you',null,null,'تجربه کردن، مواجه شدن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many old people will experience problems as the result of retirement.","translation":"بسیاری از افراد مسن در نتیجه بازنشستگی مشکلاتی را تجربه خواهند کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653858.mp3"},{"sentence":"Children need to experience things for themselves in order to learn from them.","translation":"کودکان باید چیزهایی را خودشان تجربه کنند تا از آنها بیاموزند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233368.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8a80dc03-9402-520b-abbf-66822841b6a5','638f046f-76ee-5490-a654-cab54bfb46a7',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to feel a particular emotion , pain etc',null,null,'برای احساس یک احساس خاص، درد و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many women experience feelings of nausea during pregnancy.","translation":"بسیاری از زنان در دوران بارداری احساس تهوع دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233378.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3209dce3-37c4-5840-a328-a74b2303a279','30740b5d-4593-5040-bac3-459e6d214301',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a scientific test done to find out how something reacts under certain conditions , or to find out if a particular idea is true',null,null,'آزمایش، تجربه (علمی)؛ آزمودن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/carry out an experiment They carried out a series of experiments to test the theory. He did some experiments with bats.','perform/conduct an experiment formal (= do an experiment ) The laboratory began conducting experiments on rats.','an experiment shows/proves/demonstrates something His experiment showed that lightning was a kind of electricity. The experiment proved that fabrics treated with the chemical are much less likely to catch fire.','a scientific experiment Astronauts performed scientific experiments during the flight.','animal experiments (= experiments using animals ) I think most animal experiments are cruel and unnecessary.','a laboratory experiment (= one that takes place in a laboratory ) They did a series of laboratory experiments on human sleep patterns in the 1960s.','a field experiment (= one that takes place in the real world, not in a laboratory ) In field experiments, we used patients who did not know that it was a test situation.','a controlled experiment (= one that is done using correct scientific methods ) The theory has not yet been tested by a properly controlled experiment.','a practical experiment (= one that relates to real situations or events, not scientific theories ) The research team compiled a set of practical experiments in Modern Astronomy.','an experiment to test/measure/find out something We did an experiment to test the acidity of the soil.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"experiments with alcohol-fuelled cars","translation":"آزمایش با ماشین های الکلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653862.mp3"},{"sentence":"experiments on sleep deprivation","translation":"آزمایش هایی در مورد کم خوابی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233883.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many small birds guide themselves by the stars, as has been verified by experiment.","translation":"بسیاری از پرندگان کوچک خود را توسط ستاره ها هدایت می کنند، همانطور که توسط آزمایش تأیید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653867.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('713e6fe9-63f2-5f47-87f2-f0d4fa154075','30740b5d-4593-5040-bac3-459e6d214301',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a process in which you test a new idea or method to see if it is useful or effective',null,null,'فرآیندی که در آن ایده یا روش جدیدی را آزمایش می‌کنید تا ببینید مفید یا مؤثر است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an experiment in state socialism","translation":"آزمایشی در سوسیالیسم دولتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653873.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('30e7c871-1d74-5e28-9214-ecac3f3034e2','e13a1271-e92d-5947-8753-c55dcfb6f954',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to try using various ideas, methods etc to find out how good or effective they are',null,null,'سعی کنید از ایده ها، روش ها و غیره مختلف استفاده کنید تا بفهمید چقدر خوب یا موثر هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He experimented with lighter-than-air flight.","translation":"او با پرواز سبک تر از هوا آزمایش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653875.mp3"},{"sentence":"The teacher provided some different materials and left the children to experiment.","translation":"معلم مواد مختلفی را تهیه کرد و بچه ها را به آزمایش گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653876.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('f7ce87da-5b37-5c4d-a9bc-ef05044307a3','e13a1271-e92d-5947-8753-c55dcfb6f954',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to do a scientific test to find out if a particular idea is true or to obtain more information',null,null,'انجام یک آزمایش علمی برای یافتن صحت یک ایده خاص یا کسب اطلاعات بیشتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I would defend the right of scientists to experiment on animals.","translation":"من از حق دانشمندان برای آزمایش روی حیوانات دفاع می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001233914.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('00aeca81-e53d-5089-8847-b6ac182ff712','e13a1271-e92d-5947-8753-c55dcfb6f954',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to try doing something to find out what it feels like, for example having sex or using illegal drugs',null,null,'سعی کنید کاری انجام دهید تا بفهمید چه احساسی دارد، برای مثال داشتن رابطه جنسی یا استفاده از مواد مخدر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She admitted she had experimented with cocaine.","translation":"او اعتراف کرد که کوکائین را آزمایش کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001653882.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('72ab61a6-84d9-5bd3-b096-1dd5a89147ba','94a31b22-f46b-58d2-bd17-0593243c95dc',1,'strong feelings/thoughts','احساسات/افکار قوی','spoken & written','something you say, write, or do that shows what you think or feel','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'بیان، اظهار؛ اصطلاح؛ چهره (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['freedom of expression (= the right to say what you think without being punished ) Student protestors who demanded greater freedom of expression were rounded up by police.','an expression of regret The military has not offered any expression of regret over the civilian loss of life.','an expression of sympathy There was no apology, no expression of sympathy for what Anna had suffered.','an expression of concern His release from prison provoked expressions of concern from members of the public.','an expression of anger She tried to protect the children from his expressions of anger.','somebody’s powers of expression formal (= the ability to say or write what you feel ) I tried to put my feelings down on paper, but my powers of expression failed me.','give expression to something formal (= express something ) In the book, he gives expression to his political ideals.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I decided to go to the meeting as an expression of support.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتم به عنوان ابراز حمایت به جلسه بروم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657820.mp3"},{"sentence":"The letter was a genuine expression of sympathy.","translation":"نامه ابراز همدردی واقعی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001200786.mp3"},{"sentence":"Student leaders are demanding greater freedom of expression (= the right to say what you think without being punished ) .","translation":"رهبران دانشجویی خواستار آزادی بیان بیشتر هستند (= حق بیان آنچه فکر می کنید بدون تنبیه).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657821.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Socialist Party was founded to give political expression to the working classes.","translation":"حزب سوسیالیست برای بیان سیاسی به طبقات کارگر تأسیس شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657828.mp3"},{"sentence":"Another writer who seeks to give expression to popular oral culture is José María Arguedas.","translation":"نویسنده دیگری که به دنبال بیان فرهنگ شفاهی رایج است خوزه ماریا آرگوداس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040061.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c2e9b6fb-7dd8-579f-ad90-6153c3ea11e8','94a31b22-f46b-58d2-bd17-0593243c95dc',2,'on somebody’s face','روی صورت کسی','spoken & written','a look on someone’s face that shows what they are thinking or feeling','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نگاهی به صورت کسی که نشان می دهد او به چه چیزی فکر می کند یا احساس می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an expression of surprise","translation":"بیان تعجب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657832.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was a blank expression on her face (= no expression on her face ) .","translation":"در صورتش حالتی خالی بود (= بی حالتی در صورتش ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001200775.mp3"},{"sentence":"In the photograph he seemed devoid of facial expression (= having no expression on his face ) .","translation":"در عکس به نظر می رسید که او فاقد حالت چهره (= بی حالتی در صورتش) است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001657839.mp3"},{"sentence":"A pained (= worried ) expression crossed her face.","translation":"حالتی دردناک (= نگران) از صورتش گذشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00318.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('1dac0bd6-e027-5eeb-a809-e2455521ed87','94a31b22-f46b-58d2-bd17-0593243c95dc',3,'word/phrase','کلمه / عبارت','spoken & written','a word or group of words with a particular meaning','[ countable ]',null,'کلمه یا گروهی از کلمات با معنای خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The old-fashioned expression ‘in the family way’ means ‘pregnant’.","translation":"اصطلاح قدیمی «به روش خانوادگی» به معنای «باردار» است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001200765.mp3"},{"sentence":"After the climb we were absolutely knackered, if you’ll pardon the expression.","translation":"بعد از صعود ما کاملاً گیج شدیم، اگر این بیان را ببخشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001200769.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
