 false impression she didn’t care.','the overall/general impression The general impression was of a very efficiently run company.','the distinct impression (= used when something seems very clear to you ) We were left with the impression that the contract was ours if we wanted it.','somebody’s personal impression My personal impression is that the new manager has greatly improved things.','first impressions count (= the impression you make when you first meet someone is important ) When attending a job interview, remember that first impressions count.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e35b8bba-de39-59ef-8e3e-2c278823f517','62a8b18a-41d6-5b43-8b8f-6a7dee5a8273',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is impressive makes you admire it because it is very good, large, important etc',null,null,'تحسین‌برانگیز، دیدنی، چشمگیر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The figures certainly look impressive.","translation":"ارقام مطمئناً چشمگیر به نظر می رسند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000830.mp3"},{"sentence":"Among the guests was an impressive array of authors and critics.","translation":"در میان میهمانان مجموعه ای چشمگیر از نویسندگان و منتقدان حضور داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001408758.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bfed5f07-7e05-5c44-ab22-47f01795263b','cfd59dbb-ce3c-5159-a4d2-fc021c238164',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely good, large, or great',null,null,'باورنکردنی، عالی، فوق‌العاده',array['unbelievable']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The view is just incredible.","translation":"منظره فقط باور نکردنی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375533.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was blood everywhere and the pain was incredible.","translation":"همه جا خون بود و درد باورنکردنی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375534.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0fbaed65-71ec-5b53-ac03-212e507523d9','cfd59dbb-ce3c-5159-a4d2-fc021c238164',2,null,null,'spoken & written','too strange to be believed, or very difficult to believe',null,null,'باور کردنش خیلی عجیبه یا باور کردنش خیلی سخته',array['unbelievable']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s incredible that he survived the fall.","translation":"این باورنکردنی است که او از سقوط جان سالم به در برده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375528.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s incredible how much Tom has changed since he met Sally.","translation":"باورنکردنی است که تام از زمان ملاقات با سالی چقدر تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375529.mp3"},{"sentence":"I find it almost incredible that no one noticed these errors.","translation":"به نظر من تقریباً باورنکردنی است که هیچ کس متوجه این خطاها نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001726692.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fef6fa39-1817-54f2-9eb8-9b71207907fa','5be63a69-3e05-59db-9a50-c7fb931f6948',1,null,null,'informal','extremely','[ +adj/adverb ]',null,'به‌طرز باورنکردنی، فوق‌العاده؛ باورنکردنی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Nicotine is incredibly addictive.","translation":"نیکوتین فوق العاده اعتیاد آور است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375553.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9c5e9796-8b38-5ae1-881d-c4ca942deadc','5be63a69-3e05-59db-9a50-c7fb931f6948',2,null,null,'spoken & written','in a way that is hard to believe','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'به شکلی که باورش سخت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The knife had pierced his heart, but incredibly he was still alive.","translation":"چاقو قلبش را سوراخ کرده بود، اما به طرز باورنکردنی هنوز زنده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001375558.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4368df23-7abb-5272-b60b-2e978fef4fcd','931ab3ca-91de-59e3-bcc0-16f3098844c8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a sign , remark , event etc that shows what is happening, what someone is thinking or feeling, or what is true',null,null,'نشانه، دلالت؛ نشان (پیشنهاد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dark green leaves are a good indication of healthy roots.","translation":"برگ های سبز تیره نشانه خوبی از ریشه های سالم هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733721.mp3"},{"sentence":"He gave no indication at all of his own feelings.","translation":"او اصلاً نشانی از احساسات خود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020107.mp3"},{"sentence":"Could you give me some indication as to when I am likely to receive a reply?","translation":"آیا می توانید به من نشان دهید که چه زمانی احتمال دارد پاسخی دریافت کنم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733722.mp3"},{"sentence":"Taking a career history along with you will be a clear indication that you are well organized.","translation":"همراه داشتن یک سابقه شغلی نشانه واضحی از سازماندهی شما خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001377562.mp3"},{"sentence":"Indications are that the situation hasn’t improved much.","translation":"نشانه ها حاکی از آن است که وضعیت چندان بهبود نیافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733728.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is every indication (= there are very clear signs ) that it is true.","translation":"هر نشانه ای وجود دارد (= نشانه های بسیار روشنی وجود دارد) که درست است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733729.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('867a076f-b229-5d65-b07a-a81ba33d653d','10a5061a-7a30-597b-bc47-a773ac424917',1,null,null,'spoken & written','considered separately from other people or things in the same group','[ only before noun ]',null,'فردی، شخصی؛ تک‌تک (موارد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Each individual leaf on the tree is different.","translation":"هر برگ روی درخت متفاوت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741359.mp3"},{"sentence":"the needs of the individual customer","translation":"نیازهای تک تک مشتری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378187.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('fec3bf8d-ac72-53fb-821a-79ac02d116c4','10a5061a-7a30-597b-bc47-a773ac424917',2,null,null,'spoken & written','belonging to or intended for one person rather than a group','[ only before noun ]',null,'متعلق یا در نظر گرفته شده برای یک شخص به جای یک گروه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Children get more individual attention in small classes.","translation":"کودکان در کلاس های کوچک بیشتر مورد توجه فردی قرار می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378193.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can have the bathroom designed to suit your individual needs .","translation":"شما می توانید حمام را متناسب با نیازهای فردی خود طراحی کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741362.mp3"},{"sentence":"individual portions of jam","translation":"بخش های جداگانه مربا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378194.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('9f28a779-b5e3-50d7-ac21-549cbc415851','10a5061a-7a30-597b-bc47-a773ac424917',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an individual style , way of doing things etc is different from anyone else’s – usually used to show approval',null,null,'سبک فردی، روش انجام کارها و غیره با دیگران متفاوت است - معمولاً برای نشان دادن تأیید استفاده می شود',array['distinctive']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a tennis player with a highly individual style","translation":"یک تنیسور با سبک بسیار فردی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378199.mp3"},{"sentence":"a very individual way of dressing","translation":"یک روش کاملا فردی برای لباس پوشیدن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378200.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('9859409e-9297-501c-b9ef-ba66faccfaa3','a9233dc1-b2f1-5d56-95b7-8671eb59b1d1',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a person, considered separately from the rest of the group or society that they live in',null,null,'فرد، شخص؛ جاندار (زیست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an ordinary individual Ordinary individuals need no more than 3–5 grams of salt per day.','a talented/gifted individual He had taken a group of talented individuals and built a superb team.','an outstanding individual (= with unusually good qualities ) We need a few outstanding individuals to act as leaders.','a private individual (= a person, not a company or business ) Few shares in the company are owned by private individuals.','a particular individual The writer is addressing a general reader rather than a particular individual.','a single individual (= one person on their own ) Equipment of this kind is not something a single individual could afford.','a wealthy individual (= a wealthy person ) Large ranches are often owned by corporations or wealthy individuals.','selected individuals (= ones who are specially chosen for something ) Selected individuals were invited to the dinner.','isolated individuals (= one on their own, not in a group with others ) Society does not consist of isolated individuals.','like-minded individuals (= people who share the same opinions ) The message board is a forum where like-minded individuals can communicate.','treat somebody as an individual Each student must be treated as an individual.','a group of individuals We need to perform as a team rather than a group of individuals.','the needs of the individual The fitness program is adapted to the needs of the individual.','the rights of the individual The rights of the individual must be protected.','freedom of the individual We live in a society which prizes the freedom of the individual.','respect for the individual The policies are based on respect for the individual.','individuals vary (= everyone is different ) Individuals vary in their ability to adapt to change.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the rights of the individual","translation":"حقوق فرد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378211.mp3"},{"sentence":"Each individual receives two genes, one inherited from each parent.","translation":"هر فرد دو ژن دریافت می کند که یکی از والدین به ارث می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741366.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most churches were built with donations from private individuals (= ordinary people, rather than the government or companies ) .","translation":"بیشتر کلیساها با کمک های مالی افراد خصوصی (= مردم عادی، به جای دولت یا شرکت ها) ساخته شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741367.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('4b5a881b-4bf0-5325-aba0-090b12d4f07e','a9233dc1-b2f1-5d56-95b7-8671eb59b1d1',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a person of a particular kind , especially one who is unusual in some way',null,null,'فردی از نوع خاص، به ویژه فردی که به نوعی غیرعادی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an ordinary individual Ordinary individuals need no more than 3–5 grams of salt per day.','a talented/gifted individual He had taken a group of talented individuals and built a superb team.','an outstanding individual (= with unusually good qualities ) We need a few outstanding individuals to act as leaders.','a private individual (= a person, not a company or business ) Few shares in the company are owned by private individuals.','a particular individual The writer is addressing a general reader rather than a particular individual.','a single individual (= one person on their own ) Equipment of this kind is not something a single individual could afford.','a wealthy individual (= a wealthy person ) Large ranches are often owned by corporations or wealthy individuals.','selected individuals (= ones who are specially chosen for something ) Selected individuals were invited to the dinner.','isolated individuals (= one on their own, not in a group with others ) Society does not consist of isolated individuals.','like-minded individuals (= people who share the same opinions ) The message board is a forum where like-minded individuals can communicate.','treat somebody as an individual Each student must be treated as an individual.','a group of individuals We need to perform as a team rather than a group of individuals.','the needs of the individual The fitness program is adapted to the needs of the individual.','the rights of the individual The rights of the individual must be protected.','freedom of the individual We live in a society which prizes the freedom of the individual.','respect for the individual The policies are based on respect for the individual.','individuals vary (= everyone is different ) Individuals vary in their ability to adapt to change.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a strange-looking individual","translation":"فردی با ظاهر عجیب","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001378221.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bb3080fe-525d-53fb-8330-ca791d3fc2f6','56a2b5c5-c853-5c92-9510-e47c3fae8293',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to industry or the people working in it',null,null,'صنعتی، کارخانه‌ای؛ صنعتی (کشور)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Industrial production has risen by 0.5% since November.","translation":"تولید صنعتی از نوامبر 0.5 درصد افزایش یافته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741460.mp3"},{"sentence":"rapid post-war industrial development","translation":"توسعه سریع صنعتی پس از جنگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741463.mp3"},{"sentence":"Last year 1.3 million workers took part in industrial disputes.","translation":"سال گذشته 1.3 میلیون کارگر در منازعات صنعتی شرکت کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741467.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2fcedfed-7def-5795-9ae8-035e3c352bc5','56a2b5c5-c853-5c92-9510-e47c3fae8293',2,null,null,'spoken & written','having many industries',null,null,'داشتن صنایع زیاد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a meeting of the world’s major industrial nations","translation":"نشست کشورهای بزرگ صنعتی جهان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741470.mp3"},{"sentence":"pollution in industrial areas","translation":"آلودگی در مناطق صنعتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741473.mp3"},{"sentence":"By 1900, Britain was a mainly industrial society .","translation":"تا سال 1900، بریتانیا یک جامعه عمدتا صنعتی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741474.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('d2bda8e8-ac98-5024-a3f1-8c89d2cf43bc','56a2b5c5-c853-5c92-9510-e47c3fae8293',3,null,null,'spoken & written','of the type used in industry',null,null,'از نوع مورد استفاده در صنعت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"cleaning products that are for industrial use only (= not to be used at home )","translation":"محصولات تمیز کننده ای که فقط برای مصارف صنعتی هستند (= در خانه استفاده نمی شود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741478.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('43b88614-13f5-5679-9d70-7c0a42827857','5bd90098-17a8-539d-989b-7db0683019e2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','certain to happen and impossible to avoid',null,null,'ناگزیر، حتمی، محتوم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A further escalation of the crisis now seems inevitable.","translation":"تشدید بیشتر بحران اکنون اجتناب ناپذیر به نظر می رسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001379353.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s inevitable that doctors will make the occasional mistake.","translation":"این اجتناب ناپذیر است که پزشکان گاه به گاه اشتباه کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727952.mp3"},{"sentence":"Disease was an inevitable consequence of poor living conditions.","translation":"بیماری پیامد اجتناب ناپذیر شرایط بد زندگی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727957.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2c5b8fb8-3544-5618-b693-3046bfbc0e0a','5bd90098-17a8-539d-989b-7db0683019e2',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the inevitable','ناگزیر، حتمی، محتوم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('76f43c66-70a1-5ec8-9bae-202a1c008e75','adfa9b7a-0373-534e-b30d-0de626aad44a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used for saying that something is certain to happen and cannot be avoided','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'ناگزیر، حتماً؛ به‌طور محتوم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The decision will inevitably lead to political tensions.","translation":"این تصمیم به ناچار منجر به تنش های سیاسی خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727958.mp3"},{"sentence":"Inevitably, the situation did not please everyone.","translation":"به ناچار اوضاع همه را راضی نکرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001379381.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('98a004a5-2a6d-5f23-a8d7-414d508a97e5','a9314449-c9b8-57ac-8639-711c895ac1a8',1,'decisions','تصمیمات','spoken & written','the ability to make decisions and take action without waiting for someone to tell you what to do','[ uncountable ]',null,'پیشگامی، ابتکار (خودداری)؛ نخستین اقدام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I wish my son would show more initiative .","translation":"ای کاش پسرم ابتکار عمل بیشتری نشان می داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413040.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t keep asking me for advice. Use your initiative .","translation":"مدام از من راهنمایی نپرس از ابتکار خود استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413043.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lt. Carlos was not obeying orders. He acted on his own initiative (= he was not told what to do ) .","translation":"ستوان کارلوس دستورات را اطاعت نمی کرد. به ابتکار خود عمل کرد ( = به او نگفتند که چه کند ) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413047.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b3d1e79a-9d82-58be-9a00-7c10e2f47126','a9314449-c9b8-57ac-8639-711c895ac1a8',2,'plan','برنامه ریزی کنید','spoken & written','an important new plan or process to achieve a particular aim or to solve a particular problem','[ countable ]',null,'یک برنامه یا فرآیند مهم جدید برای دستیابی به یک هدف خاص یا برای حل یک مشکل خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a government initiative to help exporters","translation":"ابتکار دولت برای کمک به صادرکنندگان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413053.mp3"},{"sentence":"an education initiative","translation":"یک ابتکار آموزشی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750790.mp3"},{"sentence":"a new initiative for peace in the Middle East","translation":"ابتکار جدیدی برای صلح در خاورمیانه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750793.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fb48d266-c2b4-5bb7-90ec-ff391a414674','a9314449-c9b8-57ac-8639-711c895ac1a8',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the initiative','پیشگامی، ابتکار (خودداری)؛ نخستین اقدام','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('290864c4-7cc6-569a-973b-296158cdd3e3','a9314449-c9b8-57ac-8639-711c895ac1a8',4,'law','قانون','law','a process by which ordinary citizens can officially suggest a change in the law by signing a petition','[ countable ]',null,'فرآیندی که طی آن شهروندان عادی می توانند با امضای طوماری، تغییر قانون را رسماً پیشنهاد کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('978827d0-1b24-595c-b3c5-16c090b4d07f','394d02b1-d977-52ae-a8a7-8f653fffc181',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a new idea, method , or invention','[ countable ]',null,'نوآوری، ابتکار (جدید)؛ نوآوری (فرایند)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"recent innovations in English teaching","translation":"نوآوری های اخیر در آموزش زبان انگلیسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750967.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ce6b6e0f-ef44-5591-863a-5cf9cfb802e0','394d02b1-d977-52ae-a8a7-8f653fffc181',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the introduction of new ideas or methods','[ uncountable ]',null,'معرفی ایده ها یا روش های جدید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We must encourage innovation if the company is to remain competitive.","translation":"اگر می خواهیم شرکت رقابتی بماند، باید نوآوری را تشویق کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413935.mp3"},{"sentence":"We need to encourage innovation in industry.","translation":"ما باید نوآوری در صنعت را تشویق کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750970.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many people feel bewildered by the speed of technological innovation .","translation":"بسیاری از مردم از سرعت نوآوری های فناوری گیج شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750971.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('df8012dc-5da7-5c89-8636-810502e846c0','f513fb4c-cb9a-5c36-a460-d34e851beec6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an official visit to a building or organization to check that everything is satisfactory and that rules are being obeyed',null,null,'بازرسی، معاینه؛ بازرسی (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a careful/detailed inspection The architect has now made his detailed inspection of the building.','a full inspection A full inspection of the site is due to be conducted.','a cursory inspection formal (= a very quick and not very careful inspection ) He made only a cursory inspection of the truck.','an official inspection Preparations were made in advance of the official inspection.','a routine inspection (= an ordinary inspection that happens regularly ) A routine inspection revealed that several lorries were not roadworthy.','a daily inspection A young airman had carried out the daily inspection of the instruments.','an annual inspection The aircraft was due for its annual inspection.','regular/frequent inspections Restaurants are subject to regular health and safety inspections.','a safety inspection A safety inspection was carried out on the boiler system.','a school inspection The arrangements for school inspections have been greatly improved.','a weapons inspection (= to see what weapons someone has ) The government has agreed to allow UN weapons inspections in the country.','a medical inspection Schoolchildren had to undergo a compulsory medical inspection.','carry out an inspection Engineers had carried out an inspection on the plane.','conduct an inspection formal (= carry out an inspection ) He was conducting an inspection in the factory.','do an inspection informal: We did the inspection last Friday.','complete/finish an inspection The inspection was completed and the relevant forms filled in.','pass an inspection The supermarket can only trade if it passes the cleanliness inspection.','fail an inspection He couldn’t join the army because he failed the medical inspection.','an inspection reveals something The inspection revealed several lapses in safety standards.','an inspection visit To date no inspection visit has been made.','a tour of inspection (= an official visit to inspect something ) Morris took off on his tour of inspection.','an inspection team The inspection team described the 1,688 pupil school as ‘outstanding’.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"regular inspections of the prison","translation":"بازرسی منظم از زندان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415946.mp3"},{"sentence":"An inspection was carried out at the school.","translation":"بازرسی در مدرسه انجام شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415949.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('447fd2fc-3f05-59c5-a175-d03fc9ae27c9','f513fb4c-cb9a-5c36-a460-d34e851beec6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a careful examination of something to find out more about it or to check for anything wrong',null,null,'بررسی دقیق چیزی برای یافتن اطلاعات بیشتر در مورد آن یا بررسی هر اشتباهی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a careful/detailed inspection The architect has now made his detailed inspection of the building.','a full inspection A full inspection of the site is due to be conducted.','a cursory inspection formal (= a very quick and not very careful inspection ) He made only a cursory inspection of the truck.','an official inspection Preparations were made in advance of the official inspection.','a routine inspection (= an ordinary inspection that happens regularly ) A routine inspection revealed that several lorries were not roadworthy.','a daily inspection A young airman had carried out the daily inspection of the instruments.','an annual inspection The aircraft was due for its annual inspection.','regular/frequent inspections Restaurants are subject to regular health and safety inspections.','a safety inspection A safety inspection was carried out on the boiler system.','a school inspection The arrangements for school inspections have been greatly improved.','a weapons inspection (= to see what weapons someone has ) The government has agreed to allow UN weapons inspections in the country.','a medical inspection Schoolchildren had to undergo a compulsory medical inspection.','carry out an inspection Engineers had carried out an inspection on the plane.','conduct an inspection formal (= carry out an inspection ) He was conducting an inspection in the factory.','do an inspection informal: We did the inspection last Friday.','complete/finish an inspection The inspection was completed and the relevant forms filled in.','pass an inspection The supermarket can only trade if it passes the cleanliness inspection.','fail an inspection He couldn’t join the army because he failed the medical inspection.','an inspection reveals something The inspection revealed several lapses in safety standards.','an inspection visit To date no inspection visit has been made.','a tour of inspection (= an official visit to inspect something ) Morris took off on his tour of inspection.','an inspection team The inspection team described the 1,688 pupil school as ‘outstanding’.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Copies of the documents are available for inspection (= people can look at them ) at local libraries.","translation":"نسخه هایی از اسناد برای بازرسی (= مردم می توانند به آنها نگاه کنند) در کتابخانه های محلی موجود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718933.mp3"},{"sentence":"However, on closer inspection, a number of problems emerged.","translation":"با این حال، با بررسی دقیق تر، تعدادی از مشکلات ظاهر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001415959.mp3"},{"sentence":"Close inspection of the plane’s engines revealed several small defects.","translation":"بررسی دقیق موتورهای هواپیما چندین نقص کوچک را نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001718938.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('e476434c-ed6f-57df-a0ea-038ecf1983df','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',1,'tool','ابزار','spoken & written','a small tool used in work such as science or medicine',null,null,'ابزار، وسیله؛ ساز (موسیقی)؛ سند (حقوقی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"surgical instruments","translation":"ابزار جراحی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417443.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9d170924-afe0-5676-b1ab-7e2cf4dd68d1','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',2,'music','موسیقی','spoken & written','an object used for producing music, such as a piano or violin',null,null,'شیئی که برای تولید موسیقی استفاده می شود، مانند پیانو یا ویولن',array['musical instrument']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['play an instrument Can you play a musical instrument?','learn to play an instrument ( also learn an instrument ) All students at the school have the opportunity to learn an instrument.','tune an instrument (= make it play at the right pitch ) The musicians were tuning their instruments before the concert began.','hire an instrument You could hire an instrument from a music shop.','a wind/woodwind instrument Violas blend very well with most of the wind instruments.','a brass instrument The tuba is the deepest of the brass instruments.','a string/stringed instrument He spent many hours playing string instruments of all kinds.','a keyboard instrument Keyboard instruments are relatively easy to learn.','a percussion instrument (= one that you hit ) Children can learn to play percussion instruments through games and songs.','an electronic instrument An electronic instrument requires no tuning and very little maintenance.','a solo instrument (= one that can be played on its own ) The organ has increasingly become recognized as a solo instrument in its own right.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"electronic instruments","translation":"ابزار الکترونیکی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798119.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9edee44b-c893-59b1-95db-cd8b8736ace3','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',3,'for measuring','برای اندازه گیری','spoken & written','a piece of equipment for measuring and showing distance , speed , temperature etc',null,null,'یک قطعه تجهیزات برای اندازه گیری و نشان دادن فاصله، سرعت، دما و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a failure of the flight instruments","translation":"خرابی ابزارهای پرواز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001417459.mp3"},{"sentence":"sensitive earthquake-detecting instruments","translation":"ابزارهای حساس تشخیص زلزله","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798122.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0dd0bbaa-9c1d-5521-adbf-7210175d9883','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',4,'method','روش','spoken & written','something or someone that is used to get a particular result','[ usually singular ]',null,'چیزی یا کسی که برای به دست آوردن یک نتیجه خاص استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Interest rates are an important instrument of economic policy.","translation":"نرخ بهره ابزار مهم سیاست اقتصادی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798126.mp3"},{"sentence":"Good management should be an instrument for innovation.","translation":"مدیریت خوب باید ابزاری برای نوآوری باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798129.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bc712e4f-88e5-5628-85e2-53ec23f7d449','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',5,'for hurting','برای صدمه زدن','spoken & written','something that is used to hit or hurt someone',null,null,'چیزی که برای ضربه زدن یا صدمه زدن به کسی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Death was due to a blow on the head with a blunt instrument .","translation":"مرگ بر اثر ضربه با ابزار بلانت به سر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001798131.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('05e2f70c-d8fc-5c4c-a970-3610e602df22','7649a540-7a6c-58d0-a299-7f0f2f686480',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'instrument of fate/God','ابزار، وسیله؛ ساز (موسیقی)؛ سند (حقوقی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('fe114bfb-7001-5ece-b7f2-284f4738f2a7','a87f937c-ba19-5a17-b4ea-14713f55cc41',1,null,null,'spoken & written','giving a lot of attention to something because you want to find out more about it or because you enjoy it',null,null,'علاقه‌مند، کنجکاو (درباره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve always been interested in music.","translation":"من همیشه به موسیقی علاقه داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420012.mp3"},{"sentence":"All she’s interested in is clothes.","translation":"تنها چیزی که او به آن علاقه دارد لباس است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420013.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wasn’t sure if he was really interested or if he was just being polite.","translation":"مطمئن نبودم که واقعاً علاقه مند است یا فقط مودب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721565.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d be very interested to hear your opinion.","translation":"من بسیار علاقه مند خواهم بود نظر شما را بشنوم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420016.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('76c8d566-8f1f-5d56-bb22-b92745c4a4f6','a87f937c-ba19-5a17-b4ea-14713f55cc41',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if you are interested in doing or having something, you want to do it or have it',null,null,'اگر به انجام یا داشتن کاری علاقه دارید، می خواهید آن را انجام دهید یا داشته باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ve got a spare ticket for the opera, if you’re interested.","translation":"من یک بلیط یدکی برای اپرا دارم، اگر علاقه دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sheila’s interested in starting her own business.","translation":"شیلا علاقه مند به راه اندازی کسب و کار خود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001420028.mp3"},{"sentence":"Would you be interested in a second-hand car?","translation":"آیا به ماشین دست دوم علاقه مند هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001721568.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bfa27d46-1f5d-51d4-b02b-640adb57b426','a87f937c-ba19-5a17-b4ea-14713f55cc41',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'interested party/group','علاقه‌مند، کنجکاو (درباره)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7d2a5ea9-aa93-5211-a780-d3d631445131','94b9aaa6-74d1-55df-9451-304a5a63670d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the use of money to get a profit or to make a business activity successful , or the money that is used','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'سرمایه‌گذاری؛ سرمایه (مالی)؛ استهلاک (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make an investment (in something) We have made a huge investment in our website.','attract investment The company is trying to attract investment from overseas.','stimulate/encourage investment The government has cut taxes in order to stimulate investment.','protect your investment It''s best to invest in several funds, in order to protect your investment.','recoup your investment (= get back the money that you have invested ) Investors will have to take legal action to recoup their investment.','a good investment Property is usually a good investment.','a bad/poor investment The shares turned out to be a poor investment.','a big/major/massive/huge investment Developing a new computer system is always a big investment for any organisation.','a safe investment (= in which you are unlikely to lose money ) Electricity shares are still a safe investment.','a wise investment (= very sensible ) A pension might be a wise investment.','a risky investment (= in which you are likely to lose money ) Risky investments usually have higher yields.','foreign/overseas investment The government is eager to attract foreign investment to fund building projects.','a long-term investment (= one that will give you profit after a long time ) Buying a house is a long-term investment.','a short-term investment (= one that will give you profit in a short time ) Interest rates will be cut on short-term investments.','private investment (= investment by private individuals ) Public expenditure in declining areas will attract future private investment.','public investment (= investment by the government or state ) There have been drastic cuts in public investment in housing.','capital investment (= investment in machines, equipment etc ) A huge capital investment will have to be made to maintain the buildings.','an investment scheme British English , an investment program American English: Most investment schemes are subject to tax.','an investment opportunity She took advantage of a unique investment opportunity.','an investment adviser He has served as an investment adviser for several major banks.','an investment banker He is an investment banker at a prestigious Wall Street firm.','investment income (= money that you earn from your investments ) The rate of taxation on investment income is set to increase.','investment funds The city is in a good position to attract new investment funds.','the (rate of) return on an investment (= profit from an investment ) We expect a high return on our investment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We plan to buy some property as an investment.","translation":"ما قصد داریم مقداری ملک را به عنوان سرمایه گذاری خریداری کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724346.mp3"},{"sentence":"That year, Japanese investment in American real estate totaled $13.06 billion.","translation":"در آن سال، سرمایه گذاری ژاپنی ها در املاک و مستغلات آمریکا بالغ بر 13.06 میلیارد دلار بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001427183.mp3"},{"sentence":"Each of us was required to put up a minimum investment of £5,000.","translation":"هر یک از ما باید حداقل 5000 پوند سرمایه گذاری می کردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001724335.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('2334e9e1-8ebf-50aa-b722-9c9ae71e6111','94b9aaa6-74d1-55df-9451-304a5a63670d',2,null,null,'spoken & written','something that you buy or do because it will be useful later','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که می خرید یا انجام می دهید زیرا بعدا مفید خواهد بود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The lessons cost me over £500, but I consider them a good investment.","translation":"هزینه درس ها برای من بیش از 500 پوند است، اما من آنها را سرمایه گذاری خوبی می دانم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001427190.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('78ee4128-8e0b-5f3c-bfcc-cfc1a4026b93','94b9aaa6-74d1-55df-9451-304a5a63670d',3,null,null,'spoken & written','when you spend a large amount of time, energy , emotion etc on something','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'وقتی مقدار زیادی از زمان، انرژی، احساسات و غیره را صرف چیزی می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a huge investment of time and effort","translation":"سرمایه گذاری عظیمی از زمان و تلاش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001427195.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d523e2fd-4121-5ed9-bb3c-25b76112831a','be4a8a0c-f80e-5c91-b8a9-2857bed2f5fe',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who writes news reports for newspapers , magazines , television , or radio',null,null,'خبرنگار، ژورنالیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a well-known journalist and broadcaster","translation":"روزنامه نگار و مجری مشهور","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001730688.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e862cd45-c7ec-5291-81da-9e9bd7d6f9f0','95283d4c-2b51-5375-af42-0f452b846016',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a special room or building in which a scientist does tests or prepares substances',null,null,'آزمایشگاه، لابراتوار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a research laboratory","translation":"یک آزمایشگاه تحقیقاتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001448140.mp3"},{"sentence":"tests on laboratory animals","translation":"آزمایشات روی حیوانات آزمایشگاهی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735488.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('083a5684-cc1b-5839-85ee-ab7d9383c6bb','6bda9a49-10f9-500e-a247-964d31516d76',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the position of being the leader of a group, organization , country etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'رهبری، پیشتازی؛ رهبران (دسته)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the leadership of the Labour party","translation":"رهبری حزب کارگر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00531.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our prospects of winning an election will be better under his leadership.","translation":"چشم انداز ما برای پیروزی در انتخابات تحت رهبری او بهتر خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735936.mp3"},{"sentence":"The US must now take a firm leadership role .","translation":"ایالات متحده اکنون باید نقش رهبری محکمی را ایفا کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735937.mp3"},{"sentence":"the Conservative leadership contest","translation":"رقابت رهبری محافظه کار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001828629.mp3"},{"sentence":"The next leadership election is due in November.","translation":"انتخابات بعدی رهبری در نوامبر برگزار می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001828632.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('667c5e40-4643-5c2e-9392-15a05df820a9','6bda9a49-10f9-500e-a247-964d31516d76',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the quality of being good at leading a group, organization, country etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'کیفیت خوب بودن در رهبری یک گروه، سازمان، کشور و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She has great faith in her own leadership qualities .","translation":"او به ویژگی های رهبری خود ایمان زیادی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735941.mp3"},{"sentence":"someone with vision and leadership","translation":"کسی با بینش و رهبری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001488683.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b6f78be5-9faa-56de-844d-b7fe8193de84','6bda9a49-10f9-500e-a247-964d31516d76',3,null,null,'spoken & written','all the people who lead a group, organization, country etc','[ countable ]',null,'همه افرادی که یک گروه، سازمان، کشور و غیره را رهبری می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the country’s military leadership","translation":"رهبری نظامی کشور","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001735945.mp3"},{"sentence":"The party leadership is in agreement.","translation":"رهبری حزب موافق است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00532.mp3"},{"sentence":"The leadership supports the change in the law.","translation":"رهبری از تغییر قانون حمایت می کنند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The leadership support the change in the law.","translation":"رهبری از تغییر قانون حمایت می کنند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('09d37b85-bbaf-542d-b317-6e92815ecba0','6bda9a49-10f9-500e-a247-964d31516d76',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the position of being in front of others in an activity or competition','[ uncountable ]',null,'موقعیت قرار گرفتن در مقابل دیگران در یک فعالیت یا رقابت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Leadership in science is important to our nation.","translation":"رهبری در علم برای ملت ما مهم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001488698.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3f4f5f33-09c7-554d-beba-8a9e421759c3','509ccf14-9791-55ea-a4c8-5684d4588407',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the act or process of controlling or reducing something','[ uncountable ]','damage limitation 1 ( 3 )','محدودسازی؛ نقص، عیب (بدنی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Any limitation to the king’s power could be permanent.","translation":"هر گونه محدودیت در قدرت پادشاه می تواند دائمی باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741891.mp3"},{"sentence":"a nuclear limitation treaty","translation":"یک معاهده محدودیت هسته ای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001465163.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('1a4c8893-5870-5950-a11b-1ec40c96cc57','509ccf14-9791-55ea-a4c8-5684d4588407',2,null,null,'spoken & written','qualities that stop someone or something from being as good or as effective as you wish they could be','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'ویژگی هایی که مانع از آن می شود که کسی یا چیزی به اندازه ای که دوست دارید خوب یا موثر باشد',array['weakness']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have limitations The system does have its limitations.','place limitations on something Spending limitations have been placed on the council''s housing budget.','impose limitations on something (= an emphatic way of saying to place limitations on something ) The government has imposed severe limitations on the types of food that can be imported.','overcome limitations ( also transcend limitations formal ) (= do more than you would normally be able or allowed to do ) Can men and women ever transcend the limitations of their roles?','know/recognize limitations (= know what your qualities or abilities will allow you to do ) Know your limitations, and don''t exercise too hard or you''ll get injured.','accept the limitations of something Take pride in your achievements, but accept your limitations.','expose/reveal/show something''s/somebody''s limitations (= show where something or someone is not very good ) The film shows his limitations as a actor.','severe/serious/important limitations This approach to the problem has serious limitations.','inherent limitations formal (= limitations that are a natural part of something ) We recognize the inherent limitations of our research.','technical limitations This odd effect on the film results from technical limitations in the video equipment.','physical limitations He has physical limitations which prevent him from lifting heavy objects.','practical limitations Practical limitations, such as a shortage of equipment, may prevent them from achieving their goal.','legal limitations (= limitations because of law ) Certain legal limitations are placed on the scope of Parliament''s power.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Despite the limitations of the survey, it did suggest some general trends.","translation":"علیرغم محدودیت های نظرسنجی، برخی از روندهای کلی را پیشنهاد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741895.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a good little car, but it has its limitations .","translation":"این یک ماشین کوچک خوب است، اما محدودیت هایی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741896.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('db7e9796-9ca0-5674-b467-cd9e0d6b1cbe','509ccf14-9791-55ea-a4c8-5684d4588407',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a rule or condition that stops something from increasing beyond a particular point','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'قاعده یا شرطی که مانع از افزایش چیزی فراتر از یک نقطه خاص می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a limitation on the number of hours children can work","translation":"محدودیت در تعداد ساعاتی که کودکان می توانند کار کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741908.mp3"},{"sentence":"The new law imposes limitations on campaign contributions.","translation":"قانون جدید محدودیت هایی را برای کمک های تبلیغاتی اعمال می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001741911.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('9712a396-b19f-52cd-a38a-fc120cc0c651','3531bf00-74c0-5b54-98df-2b8fe0dba1ee',1,null,null,'spoken & written','books, plays, poems etc that people think are important and good',null,null,'ادبیات، متون؛ ادبیات (مورد مطالعه)؛ مستندات','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He has read many of the major works of literature .","translation":"او بسیاری از آثار مهم ادبی را خوانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001503395.mp3"},{"sentence":"Italian literature","translation":"ادبیات ایتالیایی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001728227.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('40c87109-295c-5b3a-9d88-be6b17e1a6a7','3531bf00-74c0-5b54-98df-2b8fe0dba1ee',2,null,null,'spoken & written','all the books, articles etc on a particular subject',null,null,'تمام کتاب ها، مقالات و غیره در مورد یک موضوع خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"literature on the history of science","translation":"ادبیات تاریخ علم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001728230.mp3"},{"sentence":"Several cases of mercury poisoning have been recorded in the literature.","translation":"موارد متعددی از مسمومیت با جیوه در ادبیات ثبت شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001728233.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8aa1ccdf-b8b5-54d2-92f5-ecd8cc3735da','3531bf00-74c0-5b54-98df-2b8fe0dba1ee',3,null,null,'spoken & written','printed information produced by people who want to sell you something or tell you about something',null,null,'اطلاعات چاپی تولید شده توسط افرادی که می خواهند چیزی به شما بفروشند یا در مورد چیزی به شما بگویند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"sales literature","translation":"ادبیات فروش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001503407.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('29c1fcf7-a267-5c4e-9395-0c201b47e485','5ed9398d-48ce-52ae-9628-98b9cb131723',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the activity of controlling and organizing the work that a company or organization does','[ uncountable ]',null,'مدیریت، اداره؛ هیئت‌مدیره؛ مدیریت (علمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"good management and co-operation with staff","translation":"مدیریت خوب و همکاری با کارکنان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182378.mp3"},{"sentence":"a lack of management skills","translation":"فقدان مهارت های مدیریتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534242.mp3"},{"sentence":"a management consultant","translation":"یک مشاور مدیریت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534243.mp3"},{"sentence":"management training courses","translation":"دوره های آموزشی مدیریت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182379.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('8be52a68-5233-57b5-ac71-5cf551b705b6','5ed9398d-48ce-52ae-9628-98b9cb131723',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the people who are in charge of a company or organization','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'افرادی که مسئول یک شرکت یا سازمان هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The management has agreed to the policy.","translation":"مدیریت با این سیاست موافقت کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182388.mp3"},{"sentence":"The shareholders demanded a change in management.","translation":"سهامداران خواستار تغییر مدیریت شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534247.mp3"},{"sentence":"management decisions","translation":"تصمیمات مدیریتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534248.mp3"},{"sentence":"The factory is under new management .","translation":"کارخانه تحت مدیریت جدید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534249.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is difficult to retain top management.","translation":"حفظ مدیریت ارشد دشوار است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182397.mp3"},{"sentence":"a member of the senior management team","translation":"یکی از اعضای تیم مدیریت ارشد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817351.mp3"},{"sentence":"The management is bringing in a new IT system.","translation":"مدیریت در حال آوردن یک سیستم فناوری اطلاعات جدید است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The management are bringing in a new IT system.","translation":"مدیریت در حال آوردن یک سیستم فناوری اطلاعات جدید است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,8),
('4d2a102a-dfb0-52b4-90f3-1b402440e70e','5ed9398d-48ce-52ae-9628-98b9cb131723',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the way that people control and organize different situations that happen in their lives or their work','[ uncountable ]',null,'روشی که افراد موقعیت های مختلفی را که در زندگی یا کارشان اتفاق می افتد کنترل و سازماندهی می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"careful management of the economy","translation":"مدیریت دقیق اقتصاد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534241.mp3"},{"sentence":"traffic management","translation":"مدیریت ترافیک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182405.mp3"},{"sentence":"The successful applicant will have experience in project management.","translation":"متقاضی موفق در مدیریت پروژه تجربه خواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000182406.mp3"},{"sentence":"courses in time management","translation":"دوره های مدیریت زمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001753870.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('6bc8a0f6-42d1-5247-a1aa-bece62abc0ed','592f47eb-b2c3-506b-85c7-a91d7805689a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','extremely good, enjoyable , impressive etc',null,null,'فوق‌العاده عالی، شگفت‌انگیز',array['wonderful']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘How was your holiday?’ ‘Marvellous!’","translation":"\"تعطیلاتت چطور بود؟\" \"عجیب!\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000188490.mp3"},{"sentence":"We had a marvellous time.","translation":"دوران فوق العاده ای داشتیم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001572161.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can’t stand him, but my wife thinks he’s marvellous.","translation":"من نمی توانم او را تحمل کنم، اما همسرم فکر می کند او شگفت انگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752261.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s marvellous what they can do these days.","translation":"کاری که این روزها می توانند انجام دهند شگفت انگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001752262.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('1698ada1-c9f0-5803-8b9a-1836498c5c64','ec8c5fdf-2ee6-5338-a379-dc2eb69899dd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone is a member of a club , group, or organization','[ uncountable ]',null,'عضویت، وابستگی (گروه)؛ اعضا (مجموع)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['apply for membership (= officially ask to be a member ) To apply for membership, simply return the attached form.','renew your membership (= become a member again for another period of time ) Please renew your membership by January 15.','terminate somebody’s membership (= stop someone being a member ) His membership was terminated for ‘unprofessional conduct’.','be granted membership (= be accepted as a member ) Montenegro was granted membership of the UN in 2006.','be refused membership (= not be accepted as a member ) She was refused membership of the club because she was a woman.','somebody’s membership expires/lapses (= it comes to an end ) We will send you a letter when your membership is about to expire.','gym/union/party etc membership (= membership of a particular group ) How much do you pay for your gym membership?','full membership (= with all the rights that are allowed to members ) Poland was eager to gain full membership in the European Union.','associate membership (= with only some of the rights allowed to members ) In the early 1990s, the Soviet Union was offered associate membership of the International Monetary Fund.','honorary membership (= having been given membership as an honor ) His work won him honorary membership of the London Medical Society.','membership card You will need a valid membership card to enter the Sports Centre.','a membership fee ( also membership dues ) (= money you must pay to become a member ) The current annual membership fee is £20.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Greece first applied for membership of the EU in 1975.","translation":"یونان برای اولین بار در سال 1975 برای عضویت در اتحادیه اروپا درخواست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000221332.mp3"},{"sentence":"I forgot to renew my membership in the sailing club.","translation":"فراموش کردم عضویتم را در باشگاه قایقرانی تمدید کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000221337.mp3"},{"sentence":"You should carry your membership card with you at all times.","translation":"شما باید کارت عضویت خود را همیشه همراه داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628111.mp3"},{"sentence":"Membership fees are being increased this year.","translation":"حق عضویت در سال جاری افزایش می یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628115.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('9f616e6b-43fd-5cc3-95af-f48a362a4a3f','ec8c5fdf-2ee6-5338-a379-dc2eb69899dd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','all the members of a club, group, or organization','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'همه اعضای یک باشگاه، گروه یا سازمان','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['apply for membership (= officially ask to be a member ) To apply for membership, simply return the attached form.','renew your membership (= become a member again for another period of time ) Please renew your membership by January 15.','terminate somebody’s membership (= stop someone being a member ) His membership was terminated for ‘unprofessional conduct’.','be granted membership (= be accepted as a member ) Montenegro was granted membership of the UN in 2006.','be refused membership (= not be accepted as a member ) She was refused membership of the club because she was a woman.','somebody’s membership expires/lapses (= it comes to an end ) We will send you a letter when your membership is about to expire.','gym/union/party etc membership (= membership of a particular group ) How much do you pay for your gym membership?','full membership (= with all the rights that are allowed to members ) Poland was eager to gain full membership in the European Union.','associate membership (= with only some of the rights allowed to members ) In the early 1990s, the Soviet Union was offered associate membership of the International Monetary Fund.','honorary membership (= having been given membership as an honor ) His work won him honorary membership of the London Medical Society.','membership card You will need a valid membership card to enter the Sports Centre.','a membership fee ( also membership dues ) (= money you must pay to become a member ) The current annual membership fee is £20.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The membership voted to change the rules about women members.","translation":"اعضا به تغییر قوانین مربوط به اعضای زن رأی دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000221345.mp3"},{"sentence":"The membership supports the club’s decision.","translation":"عضویت از تصمیم باشگاه حمایت می کند.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"The membership support the club’s decision.","translation":"اعضا از تصمیم باشگاه حمایت می کنند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('316611d6-e7c1-5fb9-b6ec-5ec797993431','ec8c5fdf-2ee6-5338-a379-dc2eb69899dd',3,null,null,'spoken & written','the number of people who belong to a club, group, or organization','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'تعداد افرادی که به یک باشگاه، گروه یا سازمان تعلق دارند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['apply for membership (= officially ask to be a member ) To apply for membership, simply return the attached form.','renew your membership (= become a member again for another period of time ) Please renew your membership by January 15.','terminate somebody’s membership (= stop someone being a member ) His membership was terminated for ‘unprofessional conduct’.','be granted membership (= be accepted as a member ) Montenegro was granted membership of the UN in 2006.','be refused membership (= not be accepted as a member ) She was refused membership of the club because she was a woman.','somebody’s membership expires/lapses (= it comes to an end ) We will send you a letter when your membership is about to expire.','gym/union/party etc membership (= membership of a particular group ) How much do you pay for your gym membership?','full membership (= with all the rights that are allowed to members ) Poland was eager to gain full membership in the European Union.','associate membership (= with only some of the rights allowed to members ) In the early 1990s, the Soviet Union was offered associate membership of the International Monetary Fund.','honorary membership (= having been given membership as an honor ) His work won him honorary membership of the London Medical Society.','membership card You will need a valid membership card to enter the Sports Centre.','a membership fee ( also membership dues ) (= money you must pay to become a member ) The current annual membership fee is £20.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We’re trying to increase our membership.","translation":"ما در تلاشیم تا عضویت خود را افزایش دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000221350.mp3"},{"sentence":"The club has a membership of 200.","translation":"این باشگاه 200 عضو دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001628121.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8ee8deba-8327-501e-8ed9-b353825980d8','f346af96-10ce-54a9-8cee-6b9fe61bdd3e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a unit for measuring length . There are 1,000 millimetres in one metre .',null,null,'میلی‌متر، میلی‌متر (واحد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9dd45a1e-29be-588c-a26f-d69759a6da44','39141627-4996-538b-bf96-92f2dbd4c2f4',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a moral or legal duty to do something',null,null,'تکلیف، تعهد (قانونی/اخلاقی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have an obligation Citizens have an obligation to obey the law.','feel an obligation When his mother died, he felt an obligation to continue her work.','meet/fulfil/honour an obligation (= do something that you have a duty to do ) The company has been unable to meet its financial obligations. All member states must fulfil their obligations according to the EC treaty. The government failed to honour its obligations under the terms of the agreement.','impose an obligation formal (= put someone in the position of having an obligation ) A contract imposes certain obligations on employees and employers.','owe an obligation to somebody formal (= have an obligation to support, help etc someone ) He owed an obligation of loyalty to his king.','an obligation arises formal (= starts to exist ) the obligations arising out of the treaty','be under an obligation (= have an obligation ) The landlord is under an obligation to repair the house.','be under no obligation An accused man is under no obligation to say anything.','a sense of obligation the sense of obligation that you feel towards your family','a moral/legal/social obligation We have a moral obligation to take care of our environment.','a statutory obligation formal (= something that the law says must be done ) The Local Authority has a statutory obligation to provide education.','a contractual obligation (= something that a contract says you must do ) The company must refund your money in line with their contractual obligations.','a binding obligation (= something that you must legally do, especially because of an agreement ) These clauses are legally binding obligations on both parties.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"America’s obligation to its allies","translation":"تعهد آمریکا به متحدانش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001970025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Employers have an obligation to treat all employees equally.","translation":"کارفرمایان موظفند با همه کارکنان به طور مساوی رفتار کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000256797.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents are under a legal obligation to educate their children.","translation":"والدین موظف به آموزش فرزندان خود هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557457.mp3"},{"sentence":"You are under no obligation to buy any more books.","translation":"شما تعهدی به خرید کتاب دیگری ندارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001557453.mp3"},{"sentence":"Greater resources are needed to meet these obligations .","translation":"برای انجام این تعهدات به منابع بیشتری نیاز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001970034.mp3"},{"sentence":"the rights and obligations imposed on them by treaties","translation":"حقوق و تعهداتی که توسط معاهدات بر آنها تحمیل شده است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001970040.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government must pay for health care for war veterans – it is an obligation we owe to them.","translation":"دولت باید هزینه مراقبت های بهداشتی جانبازان جنگ را بپردازد - این تعهدی است که ما در قبال آنها داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001970044.mp3"},{"sentence":"a moral obligation to help the poor","translation":"یک تعهد اخلاقی برای کمک به فقرا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001970050.mp3"},{"sentence":"He stayed with the team out of a sense of obligation .","translation":"او به دلیل احساس تعهد در تیم ماند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001759955.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('b11c1f91-60d7-5e6b-9df7-72c238c00f18','cca84bf5-00c4-5b70-a907-8159af227d05',1,null,null,'spoken & written','happening sometimes but not often or regularly',null,null,'گاه‌گاه، گاهی (نه مداوم)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He made occasional visits to London.","translation":"او هر از گاهی به لندن رفت و آمد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258144.mp3"},{"sentence":"They had an occasional coffee together after shopping.","translation":"آنها بعد از خرید گهگاه با هم یک قهوه می خوردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258143.mp3"},{"sentence":"He only has occasional use of a car.","translation":"او فقط گاهی از ماشین استفاده می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760141.mp3"},{"sentence":"We should have enough money left for the occasional trip.","translation":"ما باید پول کافی برای سفرهای گاه به گاه داشته باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760142.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('745a2edc-7e4e-52e7-9ed0-592ed789e85c','299e7920-c6e4-5e7a-8ca2-c7ed32af6839',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a job or profession','[ countable ]',null,'شغل، حرفه؛ اشغال (سرزمین)؛ اشغال (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['manual occupations/blue-collar occupations (= jobs in which you work using your hands ) People from manual occupations are most at risk of experiencing poverty.','professional occupations/white-collar occupations (= jobs that usually involve a lot of education ) professional occupations such as medicine or the law Teachers’ pay compares poorly with that of other white-collar occupations.','skilled/unskilled occupations (= needing training and experience/not needing training and experience ) Plumbing and carpentry are highly skilled occupations. Workers in unskilled occupations are finding fewer job opportunities.','a working-class/middle-class occupation Teaching is regarded as a middle-class occupation. Working-class occupations may be divided into skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled.','a male/female occupation (= a job that traditionally is done by men or women ) traditional female occupations such as nursing','managerial occupations (= a job that involves being a manager ) Women in managerial occupations tend to have children later.','service occupations (= a job in which you provide a service rather than producing goods ) Around two thirds of the labour force is employed in service occupations.','have an occupation The people in the region have a variety of occupations.','choose an occupation Young people need help with choosing a suitable occupation.','take up an occupation ( also enter an occupation formal ) (= start doing one ) Many of his colleagues have taken up another occupation. Our recent graduates have entered a wide range of occupations.','follow an occupation formal (= do one ) The third son followed his father’s occupation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Please state your name, address and occupation.","translation":"لطفا نام، آدرس و شغل خود را ذکر کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258283.mp3"},{"sentence":"professional and managerial occupations","translation":"مشاغل حرفه ای و مدیریتی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760157.mp3"},{"sentence":"manual occupations","translation":"مشاغل دستی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001760158.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('6b7e26f9-f2fc-5f42-8035-5d5fec3b55ca','299e7920-c6e4-5e7a-8ca2-c7ed32af6839',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when a large group of people enter a place and take control of it, especially by military force','[ uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که گروه زیادی از مردم وارد مکانی شده و کنترل آن را به ویژه با نیروی نظامی به دست می گیرند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['manual occupations/blue-collar occupations (= jobs in which you work using your hands ) People from manual occupations are most at risk of experiencing poverty.','professional occupations/white-collar occupations (= jobs that usually involve a lot of education ) professional occupations such as medicine or the law Teachers’ pay compares poorly with that of other white-collar occupations.','skilled/unskilled occupations (= needing training and experience/not needing training and experience ) Plumbing and carpentry are highly skilled occupations. Workers in unskilled occupations are finding fewer job opportunities.','a working-class/middle-class occupation Teaching is regarded as a middle-class occupation. Working-class occupations may be divided into skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled.','a male/female occupation (= a job that traditionally is done by men or women ) traditional female occupations such as nursing','managerial occupations (= a job that involves being a manager ) Women in managerial occupations tend to have children later.','service occupations (= a job in which you provide a service rather than producing goods ) Around two thirds of the labour force is employed in service occupations.','have an occupation The people in the region have a variety of occupations.','choose an occupation Young people need help with choosing a suitable occupation.','take up an occupation ( also enter an occupation formal ) (= start doing one ) Many of his colleagues have taken up another occupation. Our recent graduates have entered a wide range of occupations.','follow an occupation formal (= do one ) The third son followed his father’s occupation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the German occupation of France","translation":"اشغال فرانسه توسط آلمان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258309.mp3"},{"sentence":"The area is under occupation (= controlled by a foreign army ) .","translation":"منطقه تحت اشغال است (= توسط ارتش بیگانه کنترل می شود).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001536228.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('bc0b6c72-21f5-5ce7-a8cb-8a16f897722e','299e7920-c6e4-5e7a-8ca2-c7ed32af6839',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a way of spending your time','[ countable ]',null,'راهی برای صرف وقت',array['pastime']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['manual occupations/blue-collar occupations (= jobs in which you work using your hands ) People from manual occupations are most at risk of experiencing poverty.','professional occupations/white-collar occupations (= jobs that usually involve a lot of education ) professional occupations such as medicine or the law Teachers’ pay compares poorly with that of other white-collar occupations.','skilled/unskilled occupations (= needing training and experience/not needing training and experience ) Plumbing and carpentry are highly skilled occupations. Workers in unskilled occupations are finding fewer job opportunities.','a working-class/middle-class occupation Teaching is regarded as a middle-class occupation. Working-class occupations may be divided into skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled.','a male/female occupation (= a job that traditionally is done by men or women ) traditional female occupations such as nursing','managerial occupations (= a job that involves being a manager ) Women in managerial occupations tend to have children later.','service occupations (= a job in which you provide a service rather than producing goods ) Around two thirds of the labour force is employed in service occupations.','have an occupation The people in the region have a variety of occupations.','choose an occupation Young people need help with choosing a suitable occupation.','take up an occupation ( also enter an occupation formal ) (= start doing one ) Many of his colleagues have taken up another occupation. Our recent graduates have entered a wide range of occupations.','follow an occupation formal (= do one ) The third son followed his father’s occupation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"One of my childhood occupations was collecting stamps.","translation":"یکی از کارهای دوران کودکی من جمع آوری تمبر بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258296.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7b55a2b2-9106-5b9b-ab5c-5c083d532d09','299e7920-c6e4-5e7a-8ca2-c7ed32af6839',4,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone lives or stays in a building or place','[ uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که شخصی در ساختمان یا مکانی زندگی می کند یا می ماند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['manual occupations/blue-collar occupations (= jobs in which you work using your hands ) People from manual occupations are most at risk of experiencing poverty.','professional occupations/white-collar occupations (= jobs that usually involve a lot of education ) professional occupations such as medicine or the law Teachers’ pay compares poorly with that of other white-collar occupations.','skilled/unskilled occupations (= needing training and experience/not needing training and experience ) Plumbing and carpentry are highly skilled occupations. Workers in unskilled occupations are finding fewer job opportunities.','a working-class/middle-class occupation Teaching is regarded as a middle-class occupation. Working-class occupations may be divided into skilled, semi-skilled and unskilled.','a male/female occupation (= a job that traditionally is done by men or women ) traditional female occupations such as nursing','managerial occupations (= a job that involves being a manager ) Women in managerial occupations tend to have children later.','service occupations (= a job in which you provide a service rather than producing goods ) Around two thirds of the labour force is employed in service occupations.','have an occupation The people in the region have a variety of occupations.','choose an occupation Young people need help with choosing a suitable occupation.','take up an occupation ( also enter an occupation formal ) (= start doing one ) Many of his colleagues have taken up another occupation. Our recent graduates have entered a wide range of occupations.','follow an occupation formal (= do one ) The third son followed his father’s occupation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"When the first scientists came to the region they found little evidence of human occupation.","translation":"هنگامی که اولین دانشمندان به منطقه آمدند، شواهد کمی از شغل انسان پیدا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000258301.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('67bb1262-c149-504d-abdf-f3572d368110','b887f346-4ad7-599c-9e6a-b3d896ced415',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the period from 1940–44 during World War II, when France was occupied by the German army',null,'see also Free French, the , Vichy','دوره 1940-44 در طول جنگ جهانی دوم، زمانی که فرانسه توسط ارتش آلمان اشغال شد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6c9e209d-ce33-5666-9b91-0236bf30fff2','822ea396-a34e-50cf-a8c6-e3d9d6d3414d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','strong disagreement with, or protest against, something such as a plan, law , or system','[ uncountable ]',null,'مخالفت، اعتراض؛ اپوزیسیون (سیاست)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strong opposition (= disagreement that someone feels strongly ) The scheme has met with strong opposition from local people.','fierce/intense/stiff opposition (= strong opposition ) It is certain that there will be fierce opposition to the changes.','violent/vehement opposition (= showing extremely strong angry feelings ) The 2,000-strong congress met the violent opposition of left-wingers. There has been vehement opposition from the fishing industry.','considerable opposition (= quite a lot of opposition ) The development went ahead in spite of considerable opposition.','growing/mounting opposition (= opposition that is increasing ) There was growing opposition to the war.','local opposition It took three years to overcome local opposition from environmentalists.','widespread opposition (= opposition from many people or in many places ) Journalists have reported widespread opposition to the regime.','public opposition Public opposition has blocked the building of nuclear power stations.','organized opposition (= protest that people express by working together in an organized way ) The proposal was passed with no organized opposition.','face opposition (= experience opposition that has to be dealt with ) The proposal faced opposition from road safety campaigners.','meet (with) opposition/run into opposition (= face opposition ) A new tax would meet a lot of opposition. The Bill ran into opposition in the House of Lords.','encounter opposition (= find that there is opposition ) The police encountered little opposition, and restored order within the hour.','express (your) opposition Parents expressed their opposition to the tests.','overcome opposition (= deal with opposition so that it no longer exists ) Nothing he said could overcome their opposition.','arouse opposition/arouse the opposition of somebody (= make someone feel disagreement ) A plan to build on farm land aroused local opposition.','opposition comes from somebody The strongest opposition came from Republican voters.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was a great deal of opposition to the war.","translation":"مخالفت های زیادی با جنگ وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267402.mp3"},{"sentence":"They face opposition from local residents as well as from environmentalists.","translation":"آنها با مخالفت ساکنان محلی و همچنین طرفداران محیط زیست روبرو هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001763821.mp3"},{"sentence":"He is confident in his ability to overcome all opposition with his personal charm.","translation":"او به توانایی خود در غلبه بر تمام مخالفت ها با جذابیت شخصی خود اطمینان دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969782.mp3"},{"sentence":"The proposals have aroused the opposition of teachers.","translation":"این پیشنهادها مخالفت معلمان را برانگیخته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969788.mp3"},{"sentence":"Strong opposition resulted in rejection of the bill.","translation":"مخالفت شدید منجر به رد این لایحه شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969792.mp3"},{"sentence":"Plans to turn the site into a £600 million leisure complex have met with stiff opposition .","translation":"برنامه های تبدیل این سایت به یک مجتمع تفریحی 600 میلیون پوندی با مخالفت های شدید روبرو شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969795.mp3"},{"sentence":"Much public opposition to the new law remained.","translation":"مخالفت های عمومی زیادی با قانون جدید باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969799.mp3"},{"sentence":"Workers found themselves in opposition to local interests.","translation":"کارگران خود را در تقابل با منافع محلی یافتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000267408.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
