('74e14883-c062-5600-9647-5338d764c5a9','e381cc7a-e52f-53ad-9c33-f940ee860850',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if you have a preference for something, you like it more than another thing and will choose it if you can','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ترجیح، ارجحیت؛ علاقه (به)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a preference Do you have a preference for red or white wine?','express a preference He avoided expressing a preference for any of the remaining Democratic candidates.','show a preference Females showed a preference for long-tailed males.','a strong preference In some countries, there is still a strong preference for sons.','a clear preference There was a clear preference amongst the staff for this style of leadership.','a marked preference (= strong and clear ) The animals have a marked preference for woodland.','a personal preference My personal preference is to eat meat only once or twice a week.','individual preferences This partnership can take a variety of forms, depending on individual preferences.','consumer preferences Information about local consumer preferences can be used by a manufacturer''s sales force.','food preferences Very young children may have clear food preferences.','in order of preference Please list your choice of colleges in order of preference.','be a matter of personal preference (= be something that you can choose, according to what you like ) Which one you decide to buy is just a matter of personal preference.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you have a colour preference ?","translation":"آیا ترجیح رنگ دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568277.mp3"},{"sentence":"a cultural preference for boy babies","translation":"ترجیح فرهنگی برای نوزادان پسر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000321981.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents may be able to express a preference as to the school their child will attend.","translation":"والدین ممکن است بتوانند ترجیح خود را نسبت به مدرسه ای که فرزندشان در آن شرکت خواهد کرد ابراز کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000321988.mp3"},{"sentence":"The amount of sugar you add will depend on personal preference .","translation":"مقدار شکری که اضافه می کنید به ترجیحات شخصی بستگی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568288.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many elderly people expressed a strong preference to live in their own homes.","translation":"بسیاری از افراد مسن تمایل شدیدی به زندگی در خانه های خود داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568292.mp3"},{"sentence":"Use clear English in preference to technical language.","translation":"از زبان انگلیسی واضح به جای زبان فنی استفاده کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568299.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('3ada58de-1469-5e01-9144-633a70f788a3','e381cc7a-e52f-53ad-9c33-f940ee860850',2,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone is treated more favourably than other people, often when he or she has been treated unfairly in the past','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'زمانی که با شخصی نسبت به سایر افراد رفتار مطلوب تری صورت می گیرد، اغلب زمانی که در گذشته با او ناعادلانه رفتار شده است.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a preference Do you have a preference for red or white wine?','express a preference He avoided expressing a preference for any of the remaining Democratic candidates.','show a preference Females showed a preference for long-tailed males.','a strong preference In some countries, there is still a strong preference for sons.','a clear preference There was a clear preference amongst the staff for this style of leadership.','a marked preference (= strong and clear ) The animals have a marked preference for woodland.','a personal preference My personal preference is to eat meat only once or twice a week.','individual preferences This partnership can take a variety of forms, depending on individual preferences.','consumer preferences Information about local consumer preferences can be used by a manufacturer''s sales force.','food preferences Very young children may have clear food preferences.','in order of preference Please list your choice of colleges in order of preference.','be a matter of personal preference (= be something that you can choose, according to what you like ) Which one you decide to buy is just a matter of personal preference.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Racial preferences are a way to make up for years of discrimination against minorities.","translation":"ترجیحات نژادی راهی برای جبران سال ها تبعیض علیه اقلیت ها است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001568303.mp3"},{"sentence":"In allocating housing, preference is given to families with young children.","translation":"در تخصیص مسکن، اولویت با خانواده های دارای فرزند خردسال است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000321998.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b4b1a77c-8913-5c87-865a-95fb1b2fb342','e381cc7a-e52f-53ad-9c33-f940ee860850',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'sexual preference','ترجیح، ارجحیت؛ علاقه (به)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a preference Do you have a preference for red or white wine?','express a preference He avoided expressing a preference for any of the remaining Democratic candidates.','show a preference Females showed a preference for long-tailed males.','a strong preference In some countries, there is still a strong preference for sons.','a clear preference There was a clear preference amongst the staff for this style of leadership.','a marked preference (= strong and clear ) The animals have a marked preference for woodland.','a personal preference My personal preference is to eat meat only once or twice a week.','individual preferences This partnership can take a variety of forms, depending on individual preferences.','consumer preferences Information about local consumer preferences can be used by a manufacturer''s sales force.','food preferences Very young children may have clear food preferences.','in order of preference Please list your choice of colleges in order of preference.','be a matter of personal preference (= be something that you can choose, according to what you like ) Which one you decide to buy is just a matter of personal preference.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d554fd0e-50c6-5369-91b7-41b1464ade6a','73397ebd-45ac-5974-b7f3-07e2b7f8923d',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to say that you think something is probably true','[ sentence adverb ]',null,'به احتمال زیاد، گویا؛ ظاهراً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"It’s raining, which presumably means that your football match will be cancelled.","translation":"باران می بارد، که احتمالاً به این معنی است که مسابقه فوتبال شما لغو خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000288242.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s dead now, presumably?","translation":"او اکنون مرده است، احتمالا؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000288243.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5e5cc455-952a-5909-98da-f9317e7f94bd','83631551-3a93-5e09-9721-fd6d6d2d9521',1,null,null,'spoken & written','before now or before a particular time',null,null,'قبلاً، پیش‌تر؛ سابقاً','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Almost half the group had previously been heavy smokers.","translation":"تقریباً نیمی از این گروه قبلاً سیگاری بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290483.mp3"},{"sentence":"Six months previously he had smashed up his car.","translation":"شش ماه قبل ماشینش را شکسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000290486.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
