('12fcaa59-cb8f-5b47-9e57-e9d610f3dce0','a1c80567-f292-5014-a908-10fab34ed9dd',8,'mathematics','ریاضیات','technical','equality in the mathematical relationship between two sets of numbers, as in the statement ‘8 is to 6 as 32 is to 24’','[ uncountable ]',null,'برابری در رابطه ریاضی بین دو مجموعه اعداد، همانطور که در عبارت "8 برابر 6 است و 32 برابر با 24 است"','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('e5bd1a69-210a-580d-b4a2-b985945b4aac','5c9d8460-9c62-5ab5-ae54-1d2ce4999e72',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to put something in a particular relationship with something else according to their relative size, amount, position etc',null,null,'قرار دادن چیزی با توجه به اندازه نسبی، مقدار، موقعیت و غیره در یک رابطه خاص با چیز دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The amount of damages awarded are proportioned to the degree of injury caused.","translation":"میزان خسارت اعطا شده متناسب با میزان آسیب ناشی از آن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001767075.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fefc3ccd-7241-5ea1-9bad-da032f8fdc5c','1c2b1245-8abf-5777-aa70-82f38dead7d9',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when someone or something is protected','[ uncountable ]',null,'محافظت، حمایت؛ پوشش (محافظ)؛ پشتیبانی (مالی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['give/provide protection ( also offer/afford protection formal ) One dose of the vaccine provides protection against TB during childhood. They say they are afforded no protection whatsoever by the security forces.','need protection ( also require protection formal ) He seemed to think that she needed protection.','seek protection They were forced to seek the protection of the army.','a degree/measure of protection (= some protection ) The shelter gave us a measure of protection against the bitter cold.','good protection This lightweight jacket gives good protection from the rain and wind.','adequate protection Some car seats for children did not provide adequate protection.','complete protection No security system can ever give complete protection against a determined thief.','greater/better protection The law should give greater protection to victims.','data protection security issues such as data protection','environmental protection A draft agreement on environmental protection for Antarctica was discussed.','consumer protection The consumer protection regulations will include new online shopping rules.','child protection Officers from the child protection team were called in after the girl turned to a neighbour for help.','police protection (= protection by the police ) He eventually managed to leave under heavy police protection.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the protection of the environment","translation":"حفاظت از محیط زیست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001591850.mp3"},{"sentence":"evidence that vitamin C gives protection against cancer","translation":"شواهدی مبنی بر اینکه ویتامین C از سرطان محافظت می کند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-0