('39df9f93-7891-5adc-addb-08adf215b0bb','28c8d7ed-cd89-581f-b296-41ac75427379',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an image that you can see in a mirror , glass , or water','[ countable ]',null,'بازتاب، انعکاس؛ بازتاب (تفکر)؛ تأمل (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can you see your reflection in the glass?","translation":"آیا می توانید انعکاس خود را در شیشه ببینید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000768646.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c8137094-29d8-5fe0-a4bb-8eb9d0687bf1','28c8d7ed-cd89-581f-b296-41ac75427379',2,null,null,'spoken & written','careful thought, or an idea or opinion based on this','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'فکر دقیق، یا یک ایده یا نظر مبتنی بر این','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A moment’s reflection will show the stupidity of this argument.","translation":"یک لحظه تأمل، حماقت این استدلال را نشان خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661613.mp3"},{"sentence":"At first I disagreed, but on reflection (= after thinking carefully about it ) , I realized she was right.","translation":"در ابتدا مخالفت کردم، اما با تأمل (= پس از تفکر دقیق در مورد آن)، متوجه شدم که حق با او بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661616.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('880d4bd5-6452-51d0-b902-f3fdb3e86115','28c8d7ed-cd89-581f-b296-41ac75427379',3,null,null,'spoken & written','something that shows what something else is like, or that is a sign of a particular situation','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که نشان می‌دهد چیز دیگری چگونه است، یا نشانه‌ای از یک موقعیت خاص است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an accurate/true reflection These reports were not an accurate reflection of existing attitudes.','a fair reflection (= reasonable and right ) The score was 4 – 1, which was a fair reflection of the difference between the sides.','a direct reflection The child’s behaviour is a direct reflection of its parents'' behaviour.','a sad reflection This situation is a sad reflection on society.','a pale reflection (= similar to, but not as good as, something else ) The film is only a pale reflection of the book.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"His speech was an accurate reflection of the public mood.","translation":"سخنرانی او بازتابی دقیق از حال و هوای عمومی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000768666.mp3"},{"sentence":"On some level, a student’s grades are a reflection on the teacher.","translation":"در برخی سطوح، نمرات دانش آموز بازتابی از معلم است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cb78559d-3187-577c-9365-e49223b04e22','28c8d7ed-cd89-581f-b296-41ac75427379',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the action or process of light, heat , or sound being thrown back from a surface','[ uncountable ]',null,'عمل یا فرآیند نور، گرما یا صدا که از یک سطح به عقب پرتاب می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('787c4427-bccb-5e06-8013-be3d8809c36a','6978123f-9a7b-59ea-bb73-05f05d0a835b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an official rule or order','[ countable ]',null,'مقررات، ضابطه؛ تنظیم (دستگاه)؛ مقرره (دولت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strict/stringent/tough The regulations surrounding the handling of nuclear waste are very strict.','safety regulations Every railway has complex safety regulations.','government/federal regulations Small businessman are fed up with government regulations.','building regulations (= relating to the structure of buildings ) The Building Regulations no longer specify minimum ceiling heights.','environmental regulations The Bill stipulated some of the toughest environmental regulations yet seen in the industrial world.','planning regulations (= relating to what buildings can be built in an area ) The house must be demolished because it does not conform to planning regulations.','hygiene regulations (= relating to keeping restaurants, hotel kitchens etc clean ) Hygiene regulations stipulate that the caterer must use suitable equipment.','statutory regulations (= that are fixed or controlled by law ) All government bodies are bound by statutory regulations on, for instance, race and sex discrimination.','comply with/meet/conform to regulations Hotel kitchens must comply with these regulations.','break regulations The penalties for breaking the regulations were severe.','make regulations The Secretary of State can make safety regulations governing the making of goods.','tighten regulations (= make them stricter ) The president is expected to announce new efforts to tighten gun-control regulations.','relax regulations (= make them less strict ) He has voted in favor of relaxing environmental regulations.','regulations apply to something The regulations also apply to new buildings.','regulations govern something (= apply to something ) There are regulations governing the safety of toys.','regulations stipulate something (= state what must be done ) The hospital regulations stipulate minimum staffing levels.','rules and regulations We must reduce the number of rules and regulations.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There seem to be so many rules and regulations these days.","translation":"به نظر می رسد این روزها قوانین و مقررات بسیار زیادی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652459.mp3"},{"sentence":"new regulations on imports","translation":"مقررات جدید واردات","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769284.mp3"},{"sentence":"regulations governing the safety of toys","translation":"مقررات مربوط به ایمنی اسباب بازی ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652446.mp3"},{"sentence":"The local authority is introducing new planning regulations.","translation":"مقامات محلی در حال معرفی مقررات جدید برنامه ریزی هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769285.mp3"},{"sentence":"All companies must comply with the regulations .","translation":"همه شرکت ها باید مقررات را رعایت کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769286.mp3"},{"sentence":"Under the new regulations, all staff must have safety training.","translation":"طبق مقررات جدید، همه کارکنان باید آموزش ایمنی داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769294.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('6facc9f1-1a4c-5caf-a95c-d69d3c73d953','6978123f-9a7b-59ea-bb73-05f05d0a835b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','control over something, especially by rules','[ uncountable ]',null,'کنترل بر چیزی، به ویژه بر اساس قوانین','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strict/stringent/tough The regulations surrounding the handling of nuclear waste are very strict.','safety regulations Every railway has complex safety regulations.','government/federal regulations Small businessman are fed up with government regulations.','building regulations (= relating to the structure of buildings ) The Building Regulations no longer specify minimum ceiling heights.','environmental regulations The Bill stipulated some of the toughest environmental regulations yet seen in the industrial world.','planning regulations (= relating to what buildings can be built in an area ) The house must be demolished because it does not conform to planning regulations.','hygiene regulations (= relating to keeping restaurants, hotel kitchens etc clean ) Hygiene regulations stipulate that the caterer must use suitable equipment.','statutory regulations (= that are fixed or controlled by law ) All government bodies are bound by statutory regulations on, for instance, race and sex discrimination.','comply with/meet/conform to regulations Hotel kitchens must comply with these regulations.','break regulations The penalties for breaking the regulations were severe.','make regulations The Secretary of State can make safety regulations governing the making of goods.','tighten regulations (= make them stricter ) The president is expected to announce new efforts to tighten gun-control regulations.','relax regulations (= make them less strict ) He has voted in favor of relaxing environmental regulations.','regulations apply to something The regulations also apply to new buildings.','regulations govern something (= apply to something ) There are regulations governing the safety of toys.','regulations stipulate something (= state what must be done ) The hospital regulations stipulate minimum staffing levels.','rules and regulations We must reduce the number of rules and regulations.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the regulation of public spending","translation":"تنظیم هزینه های عمومی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000770589.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c977009b-3512-5e19-8165-db4af6dcb43f','7df94575-4f12-534b-a8ae-3a5cb8fd85c3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used or worn because of official rules',null,null,'به دلیل قوانین رسمی استفاده یا پوشیده شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The girls were all wearing regulation shoes.","translation":"دخترها همگی کفش های استاندارد پوشیده بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000770599.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('79d42ff7-f804-5196-855c-e1210d2765f3','0de70c9a-1860-5a35-9379-265f20d2371f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is relatively small, easy etc is fairly small, easy etc compared to other things',null,null,'نسبتاً، به‌نسبت؛ نسبتاً (مقایسه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The system is relatively easy to use.","translation":"استفاده از این سیستم نسبتاً آسان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652703.mp3"},{"sentence":"E-commerce is a relatively recent phenomenon.","translation":"تجارت الکترونیک یک پدیده نسبتاً جدید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001652704.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5db05490-e1a0-5ac9-a1b6-1e37ea0c8ca0','0de70c9a-1860-5a35-9379-265f20d2371f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'relatively speaking','نسبتاً، به‌نسبت؛ نسبتاً (مقایسه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('96994862-10a6-5cfa-bd14-a3be41b721aa','158fb6a9-fa22-5bae-b7eb-6bc24dc99a3b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','unusual or surprising and therefore deserving attention or praise',null,null,'قابل‌توجه، شایان‌توجه؛ برجسته (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She has made remarkable progress.","translation":"او پیشرفت چشمگیری داشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000772904.mp3"},{"sentence":"a remarkable coincidence","translation":"یک تصادف قابل توجه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000772905.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s a remarkable achievement for the company.","translation":"این یک دستاورد قابل توجه برای این شرکت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001570514.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is remarkable that women did not have the vote until that time.","translation":"قابل توجه است که زنان تا آن زمان رای نداشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001769466.mp3"},{"sentence":"His drawings are remarkable for their accuracy.","translation":"نقاشی های او به دلیل دقت قابل توجه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000772911.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s a remarkable man .","translation":"او مرد قابل توجهی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001876737.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('16e36e2c-8627-5067-aabf-f7b3ef8f8a48','600c4878-235d-5774-8e6c-3f95b43904af',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the opinion that people have about someone or something because of what has happened in the past',null,null,'اعتبار، آبرو؛ شهرت (خوب/بد)؛ اعتبار (برند)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['have a good/bad etc reputation The law firm has an excellent reputation.','get a reputation ( also gain/acquire a reputation formal ) Over the years, the company has gained a reputation for making quality products. I didn’t want to get a reputation as a troublemaker.','earn/win a reputation As a young publisher, she earned a reputation for toughness.','enjoy a reputation (= have it ) The hotel enjoys a good reputation.','deserve a reputation (= have earned it ) France deserves its reputation for good food.','live up to its reputation (= be as good as people say it is ) New York certainly lived up to its reputation as an exciting city.','establish a reputation (= make people accept that you are good at doing something ) By then Picasso was already establishing his reputation as an artist.','enhance somebody’s reputation (= make it better ) The performance enhanced his reputation as one of our most promising young actors.','build/develop a reputation Our business has built a reputation for reliable service.','damage somebody’s reputation She wouldn’t do anything to damage her family’s reputation.','tarnish somebody’s reputation (= make it worse ) His reputation was tarnished by allegations that he had taken bribes.','destroy/ruin somebody’s reputation The accusation ruined her reputation and cost her the election.','good/excellent The university has a very good reputation.','bad/poor The city doesn’t deserve its bad reputation.','a considerable reputation (= one that is quite important ) He was also an historian with a considerable reputation.','an international/worldwide reputation The department has a worldwide reputation for its research.','a formidable reputation (= one that makes people have a lot of respect for someone or something, or be afraid of them ) After the meeting, I understood why he had such a formidable reputation.','an enviable reputation (= a good one that others would like to have ) The company has established an enviable reputation for quality.','a well-deserved reputation Ronaldo’s performances earned him a deserved reputation as a terrific footballer.','an undeserved reputation She has an undeserved reputation for being difficult, but really it''s just her manner.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Judge Kelso has a reputation for being strict but fair.","translation":"قاضی کلسو به سخت گیر بودن اما منصف بودن شهرت دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001607210.mp3"},{"sentence":"In her last job she gained a reputation as a hard worker.","translation":"در آخرین شغل خود به عنوان یک کارگر سخت شهرت پیدا کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001335.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4e793723-ac6d-5ce5-aeb1-6a0ae1c58219','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',1,'against change','در برابر تغییر','spoken & written','a refusal to accept new ideas or changes','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'مقاومت، پایداری؛ مقاومت (بدن)؛ مقاومت (الکتریکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strong resistance He prepared for strong resistance to the changes.','stiff resistance (= strong resistance ) The city government is facing some stiff resistance.','considerable resistance (= fairly strong resistance ) The proposals met with considerable resistance from our American colleagues.','fierce resistance Endeavours to change their religion had provoked fierce resistance.','stubborn resistance The stubborn resistance of the people remains an inspiring example.','heroic resistance The threat of invasion drew the Greek cities together in heroic resistance to the Persians.','token resistance (= not great or sincere ) He put up only a token resistance.','passive resistance (= a way of protesting against something or opposing a government without using violence ) Suffragettes resorted to passive resistance as the only weapon at their disposal.','put up resistance (= resist someone or something ) If the rest of us are agreed, I don’t think he’ll put up much resistance.','offer resistance The demonstrators offered no resistance.','meet (with) resistance ( also encounter resistance formal ) (= be resisted ) Attempts to modify the curriculum have met with strong resistance in many colleges. The troops advanced swiftly, encountering only minor resistance.','overcome resistance (= fight and win against it ) How can he overcome resistance to the idea in Congress?','crush resistance (= end it by force ) He added that any resistance would be crushed.','the resistance movement (= all the people who work together to resist military forces controlling their country ) Members of the resistance movement were arrested and shot.','a resistance group The resistance groups are well armed.','a resistance fighter Resistance fighters had captured a German officer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"people’s resistance to change","translation":"مقاومت مردم در برابر تغییر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745021.mp3"},{"sentence":"The no-smoking policy was introduced with little resistance from staff.","translation":"سیاست ممنوعیت سیگار با مقاومت کمی از سوی کارکنان معرفی شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626006.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a7d898dd-b22d-54e0-a922-49a1e93c1f21','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',2,'fighting','مبارزه کردن','spoken & written','fighting against someone who is attacking you','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'مبارزه با کسی که به شما حمله می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['strong resistance He prepared for strong resistance to the changes.','stiff resistance (= strong resistance ) The city government is facing some stiff resistance.','considerable resistance (= fairly strong resistance ) The proposals met with considerable resistance from our American colleagues.','fierce resistance Endeavours to change their religion had provoked fierce resistance.','stubborn resistance The stubborn resistance of the people remains an inspiring example.','heroic resistance The threat of invasion drew the Greek cities together in heroic resistance to the Persians.','token resistance (= not great or sincere ) He put up only a token resistance.','passive resistance (= a way of protesting against something or opposing a government without using violence ) Suffragettes resorted to passive resistance as the only weapon at their disposal.','put up resistance (= resist someone or something ) If the rest of us are agreed, I don’t think he’ll put up much resistance.','offer resistance The demonstrators offered no resistance.','meet (with) resistance ( also encounter resistance formal ) (= be resisted ) Attempts to modify the curriculum have met with strong resistance in many colleges. The troops advanced swiftly, encountering only minor resistance.','overcome resistance (= fight and win against it ) How can he overcome resistance to the idea in Congress?','crush resistance (= end it by force ) He added that any resistance would be crushed.','the resistance movement (= all the people who work together to resist military forces controlling their country ) Members of the resistance movement were arrested and shot.','a resistance group The resistance groups are well armed.','a resistance fighter Resistance fighters had captured a German officer.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Rebel gunmen have put up strong resistance.","translation":"افراد مسلح شورشی مقاومت شدیدی از خود نشان داده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745030.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('f23d4379-fdef-5009-b9e3-e87d53fa392d','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',3,'against infection/illness','در برابر عفونت/بیماری','spoken & written','the natural ability of a person, animal, or plant to stop diseases or difficult conditions from harming them','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'توانایی طبیعی یک شخص، حیوان یا گیاه برای جلوگیری از آسیب رساندن به بیماری ها یا شرایط دشوار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the body’s resistance to infection","translation":"مقاومت بدن در برابر عفونت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745037.mp3"},{"sentence":"disease resistance","translation":"مقاومت در برابر بیماری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773264.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7571d3df-d490-5ebb-9ff6-0ab0eb1f6bce','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'wind/air/water resistance','مقاومت، پایداری؛ مقاومت (بدن)؛ مقاومت (الکتریکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d162d335-58f7-57a7-a869-571bfc01c965','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',5,'electricity','برق','spoken & written','the ability of a substance to stop the flow of an electric current through it','[ uncountable ]',null,'توانایی یک ماده برای متوقف کردن جریان الکتریکی از طریق آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5214f0f9-73e4-59ee-991a-321d68f907aa','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the resistance','مقاومت، پایداری؛ مقاومت (بدن)؛ مقاومت (الکتریکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('24ad47b4-cac0-5368-b84d-f69eda348acb','1af43899-d291-5eb2-8140-1871f9355ad6',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the line/path of least resistance','مقاومت، پایداری؛ مقاومت (بدن)؛ مقاومت (الکتریکی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('bd9462b1-6c2f-54a8-afb1-08632df9cc24','9f556c65-3f91-5665-a03f-973010f172f3',1,'decision','تصمیم گیری','spoken & written','a formal decision or statement agreed on by a group of people, especially after a vote','[ countable ]',null,'قطعنامه، تصمیم (رسمی)؛ عزم (قطعی)؛ تفکیک (تصویر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pass/approve a resolution The Security Council passed a resolution condemning the country’s aggression.','adopt a resolution (= pass it ) The resolution was adopted by 12 votes to none.','reject a resolution The National Assembly rejected the resolution.','propose/introduce/put forward a resolution The resolution was proposed by the chairman of the committee.','table a resolution (= officially propose it ) Siddall tabled a resolution asking for the Board’s approval of the Five Year Business Plan.','vote on a resolution Are there any comments you wish to make before we vote on this resolution?','a resolution calling for something We support the EU resolution calling for a ban on the use of these fishing nets.','a resolution condemning something The UN Security Council tabled a resolution condemning the invasion.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The resolution was passed by a two-thirds majority.","translation":"این قطعنامه با اکثریت دو سوم به تصویب رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745171.mp3"},{"sentence":"a resolution calling for a ban on dumping nuclear waste","translation":"قطعنامه ای که خواستار ممنوعیت تخلیه زباله های هسته ای است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626029.mp3"},{"sentence":"They have failed to comply with the resolution.","translation":"آنها در اجرای این قطعنامه کوتاهی کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626033.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8d50053e-a66e-5e6b-ac00-b46c41b3b2e6','9f556c65-3f91-5665-a03f-973010f172f3',2,'solution','راه حل','spoken & written','when someone solves a problem, argument , or difficult situation','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'وقتی کسی مشکل، مشاجره یا موقعیت دشواری را حل می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pass/approve a resolution The Security Council passed a resolution condemning the country’s aggression.','adopt a resolution (= pass it ) The resolution was adopted by 12 votes to none.','reject a resolution The National Assembly rejected the resolution.','propose/introduce/put forward a resolution The resolution was proposed by the chairman of the committee.','table a resolution (= officially propose it ) Siddall tabled a resolution asking for the Board’s approval of the Five Year Business Plan.','vote on a resolution Are there any comments you wish to make before we vote on this resolution?','a resolution calling for something We support the EU resolution calling for a ban on the use of these fishing nets.','a resolution condemning something The UN Security Council tabled a resolution condemning the invasion.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a forum for the resolution of commercial disputes","translation":"انجمنی برای حل و فصل اختلافات تجاری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000745177.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c768ea37-6ed9-5e1c-9370-794a5f95d5d7','9f556c65-3f91-5665-a03f-973010f172f3',3,'promise','قول دادن','spoken & written','a promise to yourself to do something','[ countable ]',null,'قولی به خودت برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pass/approve a resolution The Security Council passed a resolution condemning the country’s aggression.','adopt a resolution (= pass it ) The resolution was adopted by 12 votes to none.','reject a resolution The National Assembly rejected the resolution.','propose/introduce/put forward a resolution The resolution was proposed by the chairman of the committee.','table a resolution (= officially propose it ) Siddall tabled a resolution asking for the Board’s approval of the Five Year Business Plan.','vote on a resolution Are there any comments you wish to make before we vote on this resolution?','a resolution calling for something We support the EU resolution calling for a ban on the use of these fishing nets.','a resolution condemning something The UN Security Council tabled a resolution condemning the invasion.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Carol made a resolution to work harder at school.","translation":"کارول تصمیم گرفت که در مدرسه سخت تر کار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773271.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('bfe0d94e-4e48-54f9-80be-e747394976c0','9f556c65-3f91-5665-a03f-973010f172f3',4,'determination','عزم','spoken & written','strong belief and determination','[ uncountable ]',null,'اعتقاد و عزم قوی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pass/approve a resolution The Security Council passed a resolution condemning the country’s aggression.','adopt a resolution (= pass it ) The resolution was adopted by 12 votes to none.','reject a resolution The National Assembly rejected the resolution.','propose/introduce/put forward a resolution The resolution was proposed by the chairman of the committee.','table a resolution (= officially propose it ) Siddall tabled a resolution asking for the Board’s approval of the Five Year Business Plan.','vote on a resolution Are there any comments you wish to make before we vote on this resolution?','a resolution calling for something We support the EU resolution calling for a ban on the use of these fishing nets.','a resolution condemning something The UN Security Council tabled a resolution condemning the invasion.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Then, with sudden resolution, she stood up.","translation":"سپس با تصمیمی ناگهانی از جایش بلند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001626041.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a39294f1-a8bc-5229-8310-a742deeb5862','9f556c65-3f91-5665-a03f-973010f172f3',5,'clear picture','تصویر واضح','spoken & written','the power of a television , camera , microscope etc to give a clear picture','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'قدرت تلویزیون، دوربین، میکروسکوپ و غیره برای ارائه یک تصویر واضح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pass/approve a resolution The Security Council passed a resolution condemning the country’s aggression.','adopt a resolution (= pass it ) The resolution was adopted by 12 votes to none.','reject a resolution The National Assembly rejected the resolution.','propose/introduce/put forward a resolution The resolution was proposed by the chairman of the committee.','table a resolution (= officially propose it ) Siddall tabled a resolution asking for the Board’s approval of the Five Year Business Plan.','vote on a resolution Are there any comments you wish to make before we vote on this resolution?','a resolution calling for something We support the EU resolution calling for a ban on the use of these fishing nets.','a resolution condemning something The UN Security Council tabled a resolution condemning the invasion.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2eed7f68-0905-52b4-9c57-e1630e6862e3','76b8b0a0-890f-5d68-bb90-a211ec613072',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a place where you can buy and eat a meal',null,null,'رستوران، رستوران (خوراک)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['go to a restaurant We went to a restaurant in the King’s Road.','take somebody to a restaurant He’s taking me to a Japanese restaurant in town.','eat at/in a restaurant ( also dine at/in a restaurant formal ) Have you eaten in this restaurant before?','a restaurant serves something The restaurant serves lunch from midday until two thirty.','a restaurant specializes in something Restaurants near the waterfront tend to specialize in seafood.','a Chinese/Italian etc restaurant We booked a table at our local Italian restaurant.','a fast-food restaurant (= where food that can be prepared quickly is served or available to take away ) The High Street is full of fast-food restaurants.','a fish/seafood restaurant I went to a seafood restaurant by the pier for lunch.','an expensive/cheap restaurant He took her out to an expensive restaurant.','a trendy/fashionable restaurant (= one that is influenced by the most fashionable styles and ideas ) The hotel is surrounded by elegant boutiques and trendy restaurants.','a fancy restaurant informal (= expensive and fashionable ) In some fancy restaurants, the chefs decorate the salads with flowers.','a posh restaurant British English informal (= where richer people go ) They all earn huge salaries and eat at posh restaurants.','an upscale restaurant American English (= where richer people go ) It''s interesting that rabbit has become so popular at upscale restaurants.','a restaurant chain (= one that is owned or managed by the same company or person ) Café Rouge is part of a large restaurant chain.','a restaurant owner/manager He worked as a restaurant manager at Mario''s Pizzas for 10 years.','restaurant meals There is a choice of bar snacks or restaurant meals.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We went to a little Italian restaurant near Leicester Square.","translation":"به یک رستوران کوچک ایتالیایی در نزدیکی میدان لستر رفتیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000746407.mp3"},{"sentence":"He took her out for a five-course dinner in a fancy restaurant.","translation":"او را برای یک شام پنج غذای در یک رستوران مجلل بیرون برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001562920.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company runs a chain of restaurants.","translation":"این شرکت رستوران های زنجیره ای را اداره می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001980387.mp3"},{"sentence":"A new restaurant has just opened across the road.","translation":"یک رستوران جدید در روبروی جاده افتتاح شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001980388.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('29c90a34-1b75-5ee4-bb01-0dfea46b1353','7c2092ea-7f5f-5fde-8034-74a1e929c0ef',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when you stop working, usually because of your age','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'بازنشستگی، بازنشسته (کار)؛ استعفا (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['approach retirement People approaching retirement need to consider the issue of money.','take early retirement (= retire earlier than usual ) He took early retirement in 1990 after 25 years at IBM.','announce your retirement Shortly after his defeat he announced his retirement from politics.','early retirement (= before the usual or expected time ) Staff are being asked to consider early retirement.','premature retirement (= before the natural or proper time ) Injury forced him into premature retirement.','retirement age Sixty-five was the normal retirement age for men.','retirement benefits British English (= in Britain, money provided through the state pension scheme ) Part-time workers at the company do, however, get health and retirement benefits.','retirement date My actual retirement date is July 10.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He became a keen golfer after his retirement from politics.","translation":"او پس از بازنشستگی از سیاست به یک گلف باز مشتاق تبدیل شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773424.mp3"},{"sentence":"He announced his retirement as chief executive of the company.","translation":"وی از بازنشستگی خود به عنوان مدیرعامل این شرکت خبر داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773427.mp3"},{"sentence":"She took early retirement (= retired at an earlier age than usual ) last year.","translation":"او سال گذشته بازنشسته شد (= در سنی کمتر از حد معمول بازنشسته شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773428.mp3"},{"sentence":"Dad’s approaching retirement age .","translation":"پدر به سن بازنشستگی نزدیک می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563480.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('981eb284-81fd-56b4-b631-9088d94a4348','7c2092ea-7f5f-5fde-8034-74a1e929c0ef',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the period after you have stopped work','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'دوره پس از توقف کار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['approach retirement People approaching retirement need to consider the issue of money.','take early retirement (= retire earlier than usual ) He took early retirement in 1990 after 25 years at IBM.','announce your retirement Shortly after his defeat he announced his retirement from politics.','early retirement (= before the usual or expected time ) Staff are being asked to consider early retirement.','premature retirement (= before the natural or proper time ) Injury forced him into premature retirement.','retirement age Sixty-five was the normal retirement age for men.','retirement benefits British English (= in Britain, money provided through the state pension scheme ) Part-time workers at the company do, however, get health and retirement benefits.','retirement date My actual retirement date is July 10.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I hope you enjoy a long and happy retirement.","translation":"امیدوارم دوران بازنشستگی طولانی و شادی داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563481.mp3"},{"sentence":"Will you be able to support yourself in retirement?","translation":"آیا می توانید در دوران بازنشستگی از خود حمایت کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001773439.mp3"},{"sentence":"a retirement pension","translation":"مستمری بازنشستگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000747739.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('72f531a0-090f-57a5-8e85-88d4051f641f','d32f63a6-739a-5178-9bf7-4dd9ba68275c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a complete change in ways of thinking, methods of working etc','[ countable ]','Industrial Revolution, the','انقلاب؛ چرخش (زمین)؛ دوره (چرخشی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"In the last ten years there has been a revolution in education.","translation":"در ده سال گذشته انقلابی در آموزش و پرورش رخ داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622576.mp3"},{"sentence":"the biggest social revolution we have had in this country","translation":"بزرگترین انقلاب اجتماعی که ما در این کشور داشته ایم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001622580.mp3"},{"sentence":"the sexual revolution of the 1960s","translation":"انقلاب جنسی دهه 1960","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770197.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('bb6d75cf-6657-5c3c-ba24-6e5e148489f9','d32f63a6-739a-5178-9bf7-4dd9ba68275c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a time when people change a ruler or political system by using force or violence','[ countable, uncountable ]','counter-revolution','زمانی که مردم با استفاده از زور یا خشونت یک حاکم یا نظام سیاسی را تغییر می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the French Revolution of 1789","translation":"انقلاب فرانسه در سال 1789","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749928.mp3"},{"sentence":"The role of women has changed since the revolution.","translation":"نقش زنان پس از انقلاب تغییر کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749927.mp3"},{"sentence":"The country seems to be heading towards revolution.","translation":"به نظر می رسد کشور به سمت انقلاب پیش می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001770198.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('757244ef-5566-573c-8146-5c0f30952ffa','d32f63a6-739a-5178-9bf7-4dd9ba68275c',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a circular movement around something','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'حرکت دایره ای در اطراف چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the planets’ revolution around the Sun","translation":"انقلاب سیارات به دور خورشید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749939.mp3"},{"sentence":"a speed of 100 revolutions per minute","translation":"سرعت 100 دور در دقیقه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000749943.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('3c5914e8-05a7-54f6-ac7b-feb56f501f62','6693b4f5-e68a-590d-a096-9ae6c2307f7f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','very silly or unreasonable',null,null,'خنده‌دار، مسخره؛ بی‌معنا (پیشنهاد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['absolutely/utterly ridiculous You look absolutely ridiculous in that short skirt.','quite ridiculous (= completely ridiculous ) I thought his behaviour was quite ridiculous.','totally ridiculous The idea is totally ridiculous.','slightly ridiculous Andrew felt slightly ridiculous carrying the dog.','faintly ridiculous (= slightly ridiculous ) Her urge to run away seemed faintly ridiculous now.','patently ridiculous (= obviously ridiculous ) Her excuse was patently ridiculous.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"That’s a ridiculous idea!","translation":"این یک ایده مسخره است!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578845.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t be ridiculous!","translation":"مسخره نباش!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000752050.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d look ridiculous in a dress like that.","translation":"من با چنین لباسی مسخره به نظر می رسم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578846.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s an absolutely ridiculous decision.","translation":"این یک تصمیم کاملاً مضحک است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001578852.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s ridiculous that we have to wait six weeks.","translation":"این مضحک است که باید شش هفته صبر کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000752053.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d3354828-57e1-5deb-a17a-8d2cf22cbc75','fe4059c1-23e2-51fc-89ec-8cb8ac49ff8a',1,null,null,'spoken & written','about or relating to science , or using its methods','[ no comparative ]',null,'علمی، شناخته (روش)؛ علمی (پژوهش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We believe in investing in scientific research.","translation":"ما به سرمایه گذاری در تحقیقات علمی اعتقاد داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000719774.mp3"},{"sentence":"the limits of scientific knowledge","translation":"حدود دانش علمی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581877.mp3"},{"sentence":"decisions based on scientific evidence","translation":"تصمیمات مبتنی بر شواهد علمی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581883.mp3"},{"sentence":"the international scientific community (= scientists )","translation":"جامعه علمی بین المللی (= دانشمندان)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581880.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('20e65684-d230-5cde-87c2-e14e9d0df351','fe4059c1-23e2-51fc-89ec-8cb8ac49ff8a',2,null,null,'informal','using an organized system',null,null,'با استفاده از یک سیستم سازمان یافته','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I keep accounts for the business, but I’m not scientific about it.","translation":"من برای کسب و کار حساب دارم، اما در مورد آن علمی نیستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000719780.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4b5f54b4-cb01-5c60-93a5-3f034d35d696','fe4059c1-23e2-51fc-89ec-8cb8ac49ff8a',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the scientific method','علمی، شناخته (روش)؛ علمی (پژوهش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('cbf353d6-d0b1-5989-892a-481e7be8a6df','f1c88ce8-76c5-5ae9-9775-407e0696e2eb',1,'official agreement','توافق نامه رسمی','spoken & written','an official agreement or decision that ends an argument , a court case, or a fight , or the action of making an agreement','[ countable ]',null,'پیمان، تسویه؛ سکونت (جماعت)؛ تسویه (پول)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['reach a settlement The companies reached a settlement in March.','achieve a settlement (= after a lot of discussions ) The government was determined to achieve a settlement in Northern Ireland.','negotiate a settlement (= have discussions to try to reach a settlement ) His lawyers are understood to be negotiating a settlement.','an amicable settlement (= when people agree in a friendly way ) Disputes were often taken to a village council, which attempted to bring about an amicable settlement.','a peaceful settlement (= without fighting ) Both sides are working towards a peaceful settlement.','a political settlement (= one that is reached by political discussion, not fighting ) The British government favours a political settlement in the Middle East.','a peace settlement (= one which ends a war ) Hopes of a peace settlement receded.','a divorce settlement (= an agreement about money and property at the end of a marriage ) She acquired full ownership of the building in her 1986 divorce settlement.','an out-of-court settlement (= an agreement made to avoid a court case ) The army denied liability but agreed on an out-of-court settlement.','the terms of a settlement Under the terms of the settlement, the company will pay an undisclosed sum as compensation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Union leaders and company bosses will meet tomorrow in an attempt to reach a settlement .","translation":"رهبران اتحادیه و روسای شرکت ها فردا در تلاش برای دستیابی به توافق با یکدیگر ملاقات خواهند کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919444.mp3"},{"sentence":"His lawyers are understood to be negotiating a settlement .","translation":"وکلای او در حال مذاکره برای یک توافق هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919448.mp3"},{"sentence":"Hopes grew that a workable peace settlement might emerge.","translation":"امیدها افزایش یافت که یک راه حل صلح کارآمد ممکن است پدیدار شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919452.mp3"},{"sentence":"the search for a peaceful settlement of the Northern Ireland conflict","translation":"جستجو برای حل و فصل مسالمت آمیز مناقشه ایرلند شمالی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919458.mp3"},{"sentence":"She got her home as part of the divorce settlement .","translation":"او خانه خود را به عنوان بخشی از توافق طلاق گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919462.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company paid out over $10 million in an out-of-court settlement .","translation":"این شرکت بیش از 10 میلیون دلار در یک توافق خارج از دادگاه پرداخت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001919466.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('161bbec8-f685-5a3f-9a05-9e277f43db89','f1c88ce8-76c5-5ae9-9775-407e0696e2eb',2,'payment','پرداخت','formal','when you pay all the money that you owe','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی تمام پولی را که بدهکار هستید پرداخت کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['reach a settlement The companies reached a settlement in March.','achieve a settlement (= after a lot of discussions ) The government was determined to achieve a settlement in Northern Ireland.','negotiate a settlement (= have discussions to try to reach a settlement ) His lawyers are understood to be negotiating a settlement.','an amicable settlement (= when people agree in a friendly way ) Disputes were often taken to a village council, which attempted to bring about an amicable settlement.','a peaceful settlement (= without fighting ) Both sides are working towards a peaceful settlement.','a political settlement (= one that is reached by political discussion, not fighting ) The British government favours a political settlement in the Middle East.','a peace settlement (= one which ends a war ) Hopes of a peace settlement receded.','a divorce settlement (= an agreement about money and property at the end of a marriage ) She acquired full ownership of the building in her 1986 divorce settlement.','an out-of-court settlement (= an agreement made to avoid a court case ) The army denied liability but agreed on an out-of-court settlement.','the terms of a settlement Under the terms of the settlement, the company will pay an undisclosed sum as compensation.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the settlement of all his debts","translation":"تسویه تمام بدهی هایش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733043.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wyatt had received the property in settlement of a bet.","translation":"وایات ملک را در یک شرط بندی دریافت کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001768477.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
