('cfa85dc6-3e7a-5a73-bd15-2f8108240503','8c924c0c-f6d2-5366-8a7c-b8c461369ecf',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a successful person earns a lot of money or is very well known and respected',null,null,'یک فرد موفق پول زیادی به دست می آورد یا بسیار شناخته شده و مورد احترام است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Arthur was a highly successful (= very successful ) businessman.","translation":"آرتور یک تاجر بسیار موفق (= بسیار موفق) بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743261.mp3"},{"sentence":"He later became successful in politics.","translation":"او بعدها در سیاست موفق شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000627558.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think she’ll be successful as a photographer.","translation":"من فکر می کنم او به عنوان یک عکاس موفق خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001743268.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('a6fe1226-bc39-5227-a171-1026c3a6a320','7568c4eb-33fd-5d15-9c23-ede94b78453b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','as much as is needed for a particular purpose',null,null,'کافی، بسنده',array['enough']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We can only prosecute if there is sufficient evidence.","translation":"ما فقط در صورتی می توانیم محاکمه کنیم که شواهد کافی وجود داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621205.mp3"},{"sentence":"Unauthorized absence is sufficient reason for dismissal.","translation":"غیبت غیر مجاز دلیل کافی برای اخراج است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621206.mp3"},{"sentence":"We need sufficient time to deal with the problem.","translation":"برای مقابله با مشکل به زمان کافی نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621207.mp3"},{"sentence":"The money is not sufficient to cover everything that needs doing.","translation":"پول برای پوشش هر کاری که باید انجام شود کافی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000630697.mp3"},{"sentence":"The recipe is sufficient for six people.","translation":"دستور غذا برای شش نفر کافی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000630700.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('e87adb77-39c1-538a-ba42-9badb2466a64','d9a42640-9235-5045-8cc4-36be4b5d1290',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an idea , plan , or possibility that someone mentions , or the act of mentioning it','[ countable ]',null,'پیشنهاد، پیشنهاد (ایده)؛ قریحه (پیشنهاد)؛ پیشنهاد (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a suggestion Can I make a suggestion?','offer/put forward a suggestion A few suggestions were put forward.','have a suggestion I have a suggestion for you.','come up with a suggestion (= think of something to suggest ) We’ve come up with five suggestions.','accept/adopt a suggestion (= do what is suggested ) The issue was finally settled when Amelia’s suggestion was adopted.','reject a suggestion (= not do what is suggested ) The government rejected the suggestion of a referendum.','be open to suggestions (= be willing to listen to suggestions ) We don’t have a firm plan yet, so we’re open to suggestions.','welcome suggestions (= be keen to listen to suggestions ) We welcome your comments and suggestions.','a good/excellent suggestion I think that’s an excellent suggestion.','a helpful/useful/valuable suggestion He made various helpful suggestions.','a sensible suggestion This was the first sensible suggestion she had heard from him.','a constructive/positive suggestion (= involving helpful ideas, not criticism ) Any evaluation should be fair and linked to positive suggestions for improvement.','a stupid/ridiculous suggestion It seemed a ridiculous suggestion.','a practical suggestion (= based on real situations, not just ideas ) What practical suggestions can you offer to teachers of children with learning difficulties?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Any suggestions would be welcome.","translation":"هر گونه پیشنهادی پذیرفته می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001547.mp3"},{"sentence":"The committee rejected the suggestion that houses should be built on this site.","translation":"این کمیته پیشنهاد ساخت خانه در این سایت را رد کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001548.mp3"},{"sentence":"Here are some suggestions for further activities.","translation":"در اینجا چند پیشنهاد برای فعالیت های بعدی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001549.mp3"},{"sentence":"My suggestion about menus was ignored.","translation":"پیشنهاد من در مورد منوها نادیده گرفته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001550.mp3"},{"sentence":"She took a seat at his suggestion.","translation":"به پیشنهاد او روی صندلی نشست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621282.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('e3c903cb-48d8-5f56-af09-eb465922afbc','d9a42640-9235-5045-8cc4-36be4b5d1290',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a sign or possibility of something','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'نشانه یا احتمال چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a suggestion Can I make a suggestion?','offer/put forward a suggestion A few suggestions were put forward.','have a suggestion I have a suggestion for you.','come up with a suggestion (= think of something to suggest ) We’ve come up with five suggestions.','accept/adopt a suggestion (= do what is suggested ) The issue was finally settled when Amelia’s suggestion was adopted.','reject a suggestion (= not do what is suggested ) The government rejected the suggestion of a referendum.','be open to suggestions (= be willing to listen to suggestions ) We don’t have a firm plan yet, so we’re open to suggestions.','welcome suggestions (= be keen to listen to suggestions ) We welcome your comments and suggestions.','a good/excellent suggestion I think that’s an excellent suggestion.','a helpful/useful/valuable suggestion He made various helpful suggestions.','a sensible suggestion This was the first sensible suggestion she had heard from him.','a constructive/positive suggestion (= involving helpful ideas, not criticism ) Any evaluation should be fair and linked to positive suggestions for improvement.','a stupid/ridiculous suggestion It seemed a ridiculous suggestion.','a practical suggestion (= based on real situations, not just ideas ) What practical suggestions can you offer to teachers of children with learning difficulties?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was never any suggestion of criminal involvement.","translation":"هرگز پیشنهادی مبنی بر دخالت جنایی وجود نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000631843.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government have denied any suggestion of involvement in her death.","translation":"دولت هر گونه پیشنهادی مبنی بر دست داشتن در قتل او را رد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621286.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s some suggestion that the intruder was the same person that killed Angie.","translation":"برخی تصورات وجود دارد که متجاوز همان شخصی بود که آنجی را کشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001551.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b47674ee-ba6d-572d-a651-0810d32a684a','d9a42640-9235-5045-8cc4-36be4b5d1290',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'a suggestion of something','پیشنهاد، پیشنهاد (ایده)؛ قریحه (پیشنهاد)؛ پیشنهاد (کار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a suggestion Can I make a suggestion?','offer/put forward a suggestion A few suggestions were put forward.','have a suggestion I have a suggestion for you.','come up with a suggestion (= think of something to suggest ) We’ve come up with five suggestions.','accept/adopt a suggestion (= do what is suggested ) The issue was finally settled when Amelia’s suggestion was adopted.','reject a suggestion (= not do what is suggested ) The government rejected the suggestion of a referendum.','be open to suggestions (= be willing to listen to suggestions ) We don’t have a firm plan yet, so we’re open to suggestions.','welcome suggestions (= be keen to listen to suggestions ) We welcome your comments and suggestions.','a good/excellent suggestion I think that’s an excellent suggestion.','a helpful/useful/valuable suggestion He made various helpful suggestions.','a sensible suggestion This was the first sensible suggestion she had heard from him.','a constructive/positive suggestion (= involving helpful ideas, not criticism ) Any evaluation should be fair and linked to positive suggestions for improvement.','a stupid/ridiculous suggestion It seemed a ridiculous suggestion.','a practical suggestion (= based on real situations, not just ideas ) What practical suggestions can you offer to teachers of children with learning difficulties?']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('8ed58dbb-f4b5-595f-833a-4bd8df6e401f','d9a42640-9235-5045-8cc4-36be4b5d1290',4,null,null,'spoken & written','an indirect way of making you accept an idea, for example by hypnotism','[ uncountable ]',null,'روشی غیرمستقیم برای وادار کردن شما به پذیرش یک ایده، به عنوان مثال با هیپنوتیزم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make a suggestion Can I make a suggestion?','offer/put forward a suggestion A few suggestions were put forward.','have a suggestion I have a suggestion for you.','come up with a suggestion (= think of something to suggest ) We’ve come up with five suggestions.','accept/adopt a suggestion (= do what is suggested ) The issue was finally settled when Amelia’s suggestion was adopted.','reject a suggestion (= not do what is suggested ) The government rejected the suggestion of a referendum.','be open to suggestions (= be willing to listen to suggestions ) We don’t have a firm plan yet, so we’re open to suggestions.','welcome suggestions (= be keen to listen to suggestions ) We welcome your comments and suggestions.','a good/excellent suggestion I think that’s an excellent suggestion.','a helpful/useful/valuable suggestion He made various helpful suggestions.','a sensible suggestion This was the first sensible suggestion she had heard from him.','a constructive/positive suggestion (= involving helpful ideas, not criticism ) Any evaluation should be fair and linked to positive suggestions for improvement.','a stupid/ridiculous suggestion It seemed a ridiculous suggestion.','a practical suggestion (= based on real situations, not just ideas ) What practical suggestions can you offer to teachers of children with learning difficulties?']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the power of suggestion","translation":"قدرت پیشنهاد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001621290.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7ecbc845-bfb0-5089-8674-579cfefa66fb','0a67a910-497d-59ee-82a5-f13cdca88594',1,null,null,'spoken & written','unusual or unexpected',null,null,'شگفت‌آور، غیرمنتظره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She told me a surprising thing.","translation":"او یک چیز شگفت انگیز به من گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001566.mp3"},{"sentence":"A surprising number of his paintings have survived.","translation":"تعداد شگفت انگیزی از نقاشی های او باقی مانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602411.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is not surprising that most parents experience occasional difficulties.","translation":"جای تعجب نیست که اکثر والدین مشکلات گاه به گاه را تجربه می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602414.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s surprising how quickly you get used to things.","translation":"تعجب آور است که چقدر سریع به چیزها عادت می کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602417.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is hardly surprising that new mothers often suffer from depression.","translation":"جای تعجب نیست که تازه مادران اغلب از افسردگی رنج می برند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000602420.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('89fb5b1f-937d-5671-9d1f-8145268f6221','f7432543-5561-5550-809d-c4da07ab1d86',1,null,null,'spoken & written','thinking that someone might be guilty of doing something wrong or dishonest',null,null,'مشکوک، بدگمان (فرد)؛ مشکوک (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some of his colleagues at work became suspicious of his behaviour.","translation":"برخی از همکارانش در محل کار به رفتار او مشکوک شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603206.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were suspicious about my past.","translation":"آنها به گذشته من مشکوک بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577378.mp3"},{"sentence":"His reluctance to answer my questions made me suspicious .","translation":"بی میلی او برای پاسخ دادن به سؤالات من را مشکوک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577379.mp3"},{"sentence":"She gave him a suspicious glance.","translation":"نگاه مشکوکی به او انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603203.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’ve got a very suspicious mind!","translation":"شما ذهن بسیار مشکوکی دارید!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577385.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('e37c8592-6f00-5e78-a4d7-8a4198cfb2ed','f7432543-5561-5550-809d-c4da07ab1d86',2,null,null,'spoken & written','making you think that something bad or illegal is happening',null,null,'باعث می شود فکر کنید اتفاق بد یا غیرقانونی در حال رخ دادن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They found a suspicious package under the seat.","translation":"یک بسته مشکوک زیر صندلی پیدا کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603211.mp3"},{"sentence":"a suspicious death","translation":"یک مرگ مشکوک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577386.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was behaving in a highly suspicious manner.","translation":"او رفتار بسیار مشکوکی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577387.mp3"},{"sentence":"a suspicious-looking character","translation":"شخصیتی مشکوک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603212.mp3"},{"sentence":"Call the police if you see anything suspicious.","translation":"اگر چیز مشکوکی دیدید با پلیس تماس بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577393.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her mother had died in suspicious circumstances .","translation":"مادرش در شرایط مشکوکی فوت کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603215.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('037cf1e8-2cc9-5806-91b5-5a2f17e0ead4','f7432543-5561-5550-809d-c4da07ab1d86',3,null,null,'spoken & written','feeling that you do not trust someone or something',null,null,'احساس اینکه به کسی یا چیزی اعتماد ندارید',array['wary']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was always suspicious of strangers.","translation":"او همیشه به غریبه ها مشکوک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000603226.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was deeply suspicious of the legal system.","translation":"او عمیقاً به نظام حقوقی مشکوک بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001577397.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('259bba60-b608-5347-b263-2120d55bc927','f7eab345-0c6d-5a8a-8928-64c75494fc77',1,null,null,'spoken & written','new machines , equipment , and ways of doing things that are based on modern knowledge about science and computers',null,null,'تکنولوژی، فن‌آوری؛ تکنولوژی (کار)؛ فن (علمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['new/modern technology People have no faith in new technology.','the latest technology The boat is equipped with the latest technology.','advanced technology The labs use advanced technology to study the function of various cells.','computer technology the rapid development of computer technology in the 1950s and 1960s','digital technology Digital technology is bringing the media and communications sectors together.','medical technology The advance of medical technology has meant that more patients survive.','military technology Military technology makes huge advances during wartime.','advances/developments in technology Because of developments in technology, minicomputers can now do what mainframes did in the past.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Modern technology makes moving money around much easier than it used to be.","translation":"فناوری مدرن جابجایی پول را بسیار ساده تر از گذشته می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727746.mp3"},{"sentence":"Advances in technology have improved crop yields by over 30%.","translation":"پیشرفت تکنولوژی باعث بهبود عملکرد محصول تا بیش از 30 درصد شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727747.mp3"},{"sentence":"There have been major new developments in satellite technology.","translation":"پیشرفت های جدید عمده ای در فناوری ماهواره ای رخ داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001727748.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many people are unwilling to embrace new technologies.","translation":"بسیاری از مردم تمایلی به پذیرش فناوری های جدید ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000585332.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4191a0b6-7f11-5a5d-8328-3541be1284ce','6334d2e5-a807-5a2c-8f9a-7c4695040fcc',1,null,null,'formal','a piece of electronic equipment shaped like a box with a screen , on which you can watch programmes','[ countable ]',null,'تلویزیون، تلویزیون (دستگاه)؛ تلویزیون (برنامه)؛ تلویزیون (رنگ)',array['TV']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['watch television Mum was in the lounge watching television.','see/watch something on television She saw the race on television.','turn/switch the television on/off I switched off the television and went to bed.','turn the television up/down (= make it louder or quieter ) Rory had turned the television up so loud that the people next door complained.','a television show/programme Her favourite television programme was just starting.','a television series (= a set of programmes with the same characters or subject, broadcast every day or every week ) He starred in the popular television series, ‘Friends’.','a television film/movie (= a film that has been made to be shown on television, not in a cinema ) Ford appeared in several television movies.','a television documentary a television documentary about an important public issue','the television news There was nothing about it on the television news.','a television screen Bella’s eyes were fixed on the television screen.','a television presenter British English a well-known television presenter','a television reporter/journalist Grant was interviewed by a BBC television journalist.','a television producer a BBC television producer','a television director He’s a very successful television director.','a television (film) crew A television crew were allowed to film the meeting.','a television actor/actress Peebles is best known as a television actor.','live television The accident was shown on live television.','national television The president went on national television to appeal for calm.','satellite/cable television They have a dish for satellite television.','digital television the switchover to digital television','terrestrial television British English (= television that is not broadcast using a satellite or cable ) Many of these matches are not available on terrestrial television.','high definition/HD television high definition television channels','a widescreen television Widescreen televisions are getting more popular, especially in home cinema systems.','a plasma/LCD television Each hotel room has a minibar and plasma television.','a flat screen television a buyer’s guide to the latest flat screen televisions','a colour television a 32 inch colour television','a black-and-white television They had an old black and white television in the garage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Lucy turned on the television to watch the evening news.","translation":"لوسی تلویزیون را روشن کرد تا اخبار عصر را تماشا کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619563.mp3"},{"sentence":"They have a television in every room.","translation":"آنها در هر اتاق یک تلویزیون دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001581.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s on TV tonight?","translation":"امشب در تلویزیون چه خبر است؟","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,3),
('d7c5c9bf-4255-531f-8c2d-b4809a7c6f10','6334d2e5-a807-5a2c-8f9a-7c4695040fcc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the programmes broadcast in this way','[ uncountable ]',null,'برنامه ها به این شکل پخش می شود',array['TV']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['watch television Mum was in the lounge watching television.','see/watch something on television She saw the race on television.','turn/switch the television on/off I switched off the television and went to bed.','turn the television up/down (= make it louder or quieter ) Rory had turned the television up so loud that the people next door complained.','a television show/programme Her favourite television programme was just starting.','a television series (= a set of programmes with the same characters or subject, broadcast every day or every week ) He starred in the popular television series, ‘Friends’.','a television film/movie (= a film that has been made to be shown on television, not in a cinema ) Ford appeared in several television movies.','a television documentary a television documentary about an important public issue','the television news There was nothing about it on the television news.','a television screen Bella’s eyes were fixed on the television screen.','a television presenter British English a well-known television presenter','a television reporter/journalist Grant was interviewed by a BBC television journalist.','a television producer a BBC television producer','a television director He’s a very successful television director.','a television (film) crew A television crew were allowed to film the meeting.','a television actor/actress Peebles is best known as a television actor.','live television The accident was shown on live television.','national television The president went on national television to appeal for calm.','satellite/cable television They have a dish for satellite television.','digital television the switchover to digital television','terrestrial television British English (= television that is not broadcast using a satellite or cable ) Many of these matches are not available on terrestrial television.','high definition/HD television high definition television channels','a widescreen television Widescreen televisions are getting more popular, especially in home cinema systems.','a plasma/LCD television Each hotel room has a minibar and plasma television.','a flat screen television a buyer’s guide to the latest flat screen televisions','a colour television a 32 inch colour television','a black-and-white television They had an old black and white television in the garage.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"In the evenings I like to relax and watch television.","translation":"عصرها دوست دارم استراحت کنم و تلویزیون تماشا کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001619570.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
