('4dda6ffc-875a-502d-9a74-ebac344918a0','6c444178-4288-5e81-8665-8d45697e59eb',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an organization that consists of a group of people who have the same aims , do the same kind of work etc','[ countable ]','housing association','انجمن، سازمان؛ ارتباط، پیوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the Association of Master Builders","translation":"انجمن استادان سازان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000924470.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('21ae2df2-8460-5f57-a65e-46f0e3b08e25','6c444178-4288-5e81-8665-8d45697e59eb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a relationship with a particular person, organization, group etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'رابطه با یک فرد خاص، سازمان، گروه و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"his close association with the Green Party","translation":"ارتباط نزدیک او با حزب سبز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000924479.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b904a835-fbfa-5013-bcc3-720ba2790aeb','6c444178-4288-5e81-8665-8d45697e59eb',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'in association with somebody/something','انجمن، سازمان؛ ارتباط، پیوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('727719f8-8061-59a3-803e-da3934b265f5','6c444178-4288-5e81-8665-8d45697e59eb',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a connection or relationship between two events, ideas, situations etc','[ countable ]',null,'ارتباط یا رابطه بین دو رویداد، ایده، موقعیت و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the strong association between the disease and middle-aged women","translation":"ارتباط قوی بین این بیماری و زنان میانسال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001744628.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9cbd1ad5-a8fc-5406-ba65-7e1c469f61fa','6c444178-4288-5e81-8665-8d45697e59eb',5,null,null,'spoken & written','a feeling or memory that is related to a particular place, event, word etc','[ countable ]',null,'احساس یا خاطره ای که مربوط به مکان، رویداد، کلمه خاصی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Scotland has all kinds of happy associations for me.","translation":"اسکاتلند برای من انواع و اقسام انجمن های شاد دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000924483.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4afd0746-a55e-568c-aeba-744994dc1d42','3103d321-33af-509f-9877-3df0e4fcab97',1,null,null,'spoken & written','when you use numbers in order to find out an amount, price , or value','[ countable usually plural, uncountable ]',null,'محاسبه، حساب؛ گمان، برآورد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/make a calculation The children should be able to do that calculation in their heads.','perform a calculation formal (= do one ) Computers can perform calculations very quickly.','a simple calculation A simple calculation will show that these figures are incorrect.','a rough calculation (= not very detailed or exact ) I made a few rough calculations of how much it would cost.','a quick/rapid calculation He did a rapid calculation.','a detailed calculation Your report must be supported by detailed calculations.','complex calculations Computers can be used to handle complex calculations.','mathematical calculations pages of mathematical calculations','somebody''s calculations are right/correct/accurate Fortunately his calculations were accurate.','somebody''s calculations are wrong/inaccurate Some of our calculations were wrong.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dee looked at the bill and made some rapid calculations.","translation":"دی به صورت حساب نگاه کرد و محاسبات سریعی انجام داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000892225.mp3"},{"sentence":"By some calculations, the population will reach eight million soon.","translation":"با برخی محاسبات به زودی جمعیت به هشت میلیون نفر خواهد رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000246.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('406c2acd-34f9-5b9b-943c-b26cac716a02','3103d321-33af-509f-9877-3df0e4fcab97',2,null,null,'spoken & written','careful planning in order to get what you want, especially without caring about the effects on other people','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'برنامه ریزی دقیق برای رسیدن به آنچه می خواهید، به خصوص بدون توجه به تأثیرات آن بر دیگران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/make a calculation The children should be able to do that calculation in their heads.','perform a calculation formal (= do one ) Computers can perform calculations very quickly.','a simple calculation A simple calculation will show that these figures are incorrect.','a rough calculation (= not very detailed or exact ) I made a few rough calculations of how much it would cost.','a quick/rapid calculation He did a rapid calculation.','a detailed calculation Your report must be supported by detailed calculations.','complex calculations Computers can be used to handle complex calculations.','mathematical calculations pages of mathematical calculations','somebody''s calculations are right/correct/accurate Fortunately his calculations were accurate.','somebody''s calculations are wrong/inaccurate Some of our calculations were wrong.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"political calculation","translation":"محاسبه سیاسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001679299.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a675b761-f9b0-5000-b655-8c849a0360ad','3103d321-33af-509f-9877-3df0e4fcab97',3,null,null,'spoken & written','when you think carefully about what the probable results will be if you do something','[ uncountable ]',null,'وقتی به دقت فکر می کنید که اگر کاری انجام دهید، نتایج احتمالی آن چه خواهد بود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do/make a calculation The children should be able to do that calculation in their heads.','perform a calculation formal (= do one ) Computers can perform calculations very quickly.','a simple calculation A simple calculation will show that these figures are incorrect.','a rough calculation (= not very detailed or exact ) I made a few rough calculations of how much it would cost.','a quick/rapid calculation He did a rapid calculation.','a detailed calculation Your report must be supported by detailed calculations.','complex calculations Computers can be used to handle complex calculations.','mathematical calculations pages of mathematical calculations','somebody''s calculations are right/correct/accurate Fortunately his calculations were accurate.','somebody''s calculations are wrong/inaccurate Some of our calculations were wrong.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6d32b1d9-f106-5ba1-8afc-6cf1ef4100e7','3ec843db-365d-59b4-8f85-310e961327ed',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an occasion or party when you celebrate something','[ countable ]',null,'جشن، مراسم جشن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/small celebration We’re having a small celebration for Dad’s birthday.','a family celebration (= for family members ) Everyone’s coming here for a family celebration.','a special celebration There’s a special celebration tonight to mark the school’s 50th anniversary.','a double celebration (= for two good things ) It’s a double celebration for our first wedding anniversary and my birthday.','a birthday/anniversary celebration He is planning a very special 40th birthday celebration. It was the college’s 150th anniversary celebration last night.','a victory celebration Some football fans were arrested during the victory celebrations.','Christmas/New Year celebrations They invited me to join in their Christmas celebrations.','wedding celebrations The wedding celebrations can last for a week or more.','centenary celebrations (= celebrating 100 years after a special event ) A special committee was formed to organize the centenary celebrations.','a national celebration The flag flies for a national celebration.','have a celebration The villagers were having a celebration of some kind.','hold/host a celebration formal: The company is holding a celebration for its 75th anniversary.','join in the celebrations You’re welcome to come and join in the celebrations!']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the lively New Year celebrations in the city centre","translation":"جشن های پر جنب و جوش سال نو در مرکز شهر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659016.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('1e3ca194-d236-53a9-923e-0354b9b78b18','3ec843db-365d-59b4-8f85-310e961327ed',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the act of celebrating','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'عمل جشن گرفتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/small celebration We’re having a small celebration for Dad’s birthday.','a family celebration (= for family members ) Everyone’s coming here for a family celebration.','a special celebration There’s a special celebration tonight to mark the school’s 50th anniversary.','a double celebration (= for two good things ) It’s a double celebration for our first wedding anniversary and my birthday.','a birthday/anniversary celebration He is planning a very special 40th birthday celebration. It was the college’s 150th anniversary celebration last night.','a victory celebration Some football fans were arrested during the victory celebrations.','Christmas/New Year celebrations They invited me to join in their Christmas celebrations.','wedding celebrations The wedding celebrations can last for a week or more.','centenary celebrations (= celebrating 100 years after a special event ) A special committee was formed to organize the centenary celebrations.','a national celebration The flag flies for a national celebration.','have a celebration The villagers were having a celebration of some kind.','hold/host a celebration formal: The company is holding a celebration for its 75th anniversary.','join in the celebrations You’re welcome to come and join in the celebrations!']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a reception in celebration of the Fund’s 70th Anniversary","translation":"پذیرایی در جشن هفتادمین سالگرد تاسیس صندوق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000877845.mp3"},{"sentence":"The show is a celebration of new young talent.","translation":"این نمایش تجلیل از استعدادهای جوان جدید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659019.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think this is a cause for celebration (= reason to celebrate ) .","translation":"من فکر می کنم این یک دلیل برای جشن (= دلیل برای جشن گرفتن) است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659020.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ad3953fb-e5ea-5e71-8b68-4c171c81683f','d8650729-5879-5e97-8732-6454c5d1e9c6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an official document that states that a fact or facts are true',null,null,'گواهی‌نامه، سند رسمی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a medical certificate You can get a medical certificate that shows which vaccinations you''ve had.','a birth certificate In order to get a passport, you''ll need your birth certificate.','a marriage certificate He found a copy of his parents'' marriage certificate.','a death certificate According to his death certificate, he died aged 44.','a share certificate (= proving what shares someone owns ) She kept official letters and share certificates in a locked case.','issue a certificate (= officially provide one ) The certificate will be issued upon payment of the fee.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('ae67824b-8659-5826-a25c-b4edf54032e0','d8650729-5879-5e97-8732-6454c5d1e9c6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an official paper stating that you have completed a course of study or passed an examination',null,null,'یک مقاله رسمی مبنی بر اینکه یک دوره تحصیلی را به پایان رسانده اید یا امتحانی را پشت سر گذاشته اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a medical certificate You can get a medical certificate that shows which vaccinations you''ve had.','a birth certificate In order to get a passport, you''ll need your birth certificate.','a marriage certificate He found a copy of his parents'' marriage certificate.','a death certificate According to his death certificate, he died aged 44.','a share certificate (= proving what shares someone owns ) She kept official letters and share certificates in a locked case.','issue a certificate (= officially provide one ) The certificate will be issued upon payment of the fee.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a degree certificate","translation":"گواهی مدرک","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001659247.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5fb9ad84-6030-5a8f-bfa3-b4e39d70a3b6','ed80cfd8-e2c7-5367-ba7b-bd71a95a84d2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','two or more different things that exist together or are used or put together','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ترکیب، ترکیب‌بندی؛ پیوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A combination of factors may be responsible for the increase in cancer.","translation":"ترکیبی از عوامل ممکن است مسئول افزایش سرطان باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088909.mp3"},{"sentence":"A combination of tact and authority was needed to deal with the situation.","translation":"ترکیبی از درایت و اقتدار برای مقابله با شرایط لازم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088911.mp3"},{"sentence":"Certain combinations of sounds are not possible in English.","translation":"ترکیب خاصی از صداها در انگلیسی امکان پذیر نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088919.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some drugs which are safe when taken separately are lethal in combination.","translation":"برخی از داروهایی که هنگام مصرف جداگانه بی خطر هستند، در ترکیب آنها کشنده هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088914.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3aef7597-57dd-53a2-baaf-ffe9aa6e55ff','ed80cfd8-e2c7-5367-ba7b-bd71a95a84d2',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the series of numbers or letters you need to open a combination lock','[ countable ]',null,'سری اعداد یا حروفی که برای باز کردن قفل ترکیبی نیاز دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('be02f677-e440-5a0e-a5b1-8928b2f9ef76','ed80cfd8-e2c7-5367-ba7b-bd71a95a84d2',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'winning combination','ترکیب، ترکیب‌بندی؛ پیوند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d414abed-37bf-5851-9c3d-68bef7137c02','ed80cfd8-e2c7-5367-ba7b-bd71a95a84d2',4,null,null,'spoken & written','used before a noun to mean that something has more than one purpose or uses more than one method','[ uncountable ]',null,'قبل از اسم به این معنی است که چیزی بیش از یک هدف دارد یا از بیش از یک روش استفاده می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a combination nightclub and café","translation":"یک کلوپ شبانه و کافه ترکیبی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695579.mp3"},{"sentence":"new combination drug therapies","translation":"درمان دارویی ترکیبی جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001088937.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('5265d675-ff9b-50e4-b992-67c12fdaa88f','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',1,'furniture/places/clothes etc','مبلمان / مکان / لباس و غیره','spoken & written','making you feel physically relaxed , without any pain or without being too hot , cold etc',null,null,'راحت، آسوده؛ (درآمد) مرفه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The bed wasn’t particularly comfortable.","translation":"تخت خیلی راحت نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695668.mp3"},{"sentence":"Joyce has a comfortable apartment in Portland.","translation":"جویس یک آپارتمان راحت در پورتلند دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001094692.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wear loose comfortable clothing.","translation":"لباس راحتی گشاد بپوشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695673.mp3"},{"sentence":"Linen is very comfortable to wear.","translation":"پوشیدن کتانی بسیار راحت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001094696.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3430c33f-0f2b-5e38-9e14-3887ed7e600e','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',2,'physically relaxed','از نظر جسمی آرام است','spoken & written','feeling physically relaxed, without any pain or without being too hot, cold etc',null,null,'احساس آرامش جسمی، بدون درد یا بدون گرما، سرما و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was so comfortable and warm in bed I didn’t want to get up.","translation":"آنقدر در رختخواب راحت و گرم بودم که نمی خواستم بلند شوم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001094683.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sit down and make yourself comfortable .","translation":"بشین و خودتو راحت کن .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001094686.mp3"},{"sentence":"With difficulty, she rolled her body into a more comfortable position .","translation":"به سختی بدنش را در موقعیت راحت تری قرار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695678.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('31c3c72a-c367-54ae-8958-64da813fc879','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',3,'confident','مطمئن','spoken & written','confident , relaxed, and not worried','[ not before noun ]',null,'با اعتماد به نفس، آرام و بدون نگرانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s never felt very comfortable with men.","translation":"او هرگز با مردان احساس راحتی نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001094702.mp3"},{"sentence":"In our business, we need people who are comfortable in an unstructured environment.","translation":"در تجارت ما به افرادی نیاز داریم که در یک محیط بدون ساختار راحت باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695691.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0ddc2d32-aafc-58fa-8c1e-6dd9b266e80d','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',4,'money','پول','spoken & written','having enough money to buy the things you need or want, without having to worry about how much they cost',null,null,'داشتن پول کافی برای خرید چیزهایی که نیاز دارید یا می خواهید، بدون اینکه نگران هزینه آنها باشید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jean’s looking forward to a comfortable retirement.","translation":"ژان منتظر یک بازنشستگی راحت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695695.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('136fe37b-773e-5cdd-8e56-d22f1d0a2d9a','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',5,'competition/vote','رقابت/رای','spoken & written','if you have a comfortable win or lead, you win or are leading by a large amount','[ usually before noun ]',null,'اگر یک برد راحت یا پیشرو داشته باشید، برنده شده اید یا با مقدار زیادی پیشرو هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The pair had a comfortable win, beating the German team by nearly three seconds.","translation":"این زوج یک برد راحت کسب کردند و تیم آلمان را نزدیک به سه ثانیه شکست دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695701.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bill should pass in the House by a comfortable margin .","translation":"این لایحه باید با یک حاشیه راحت در مجلس تصویب شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695702.mp3"},{"sentence":"Another penalty from Roberts gave the home team a comfortable half-time lead .","translation":"یک پنالتی دیگر از رابرتز باعث شد تا تیم میزبان در نیمه اول برتری خوبی داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001695706.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b07074c6-36b8-57f4-b3c4-1ed8d25f9def','dc694511-83f0-531f-ad45-87d8f1745aed',6,'ill/injured','بیمار/مصدوم','spoken & written','if someone who is ill or injured is comfortable, they are not in too much pain','[ not before noun ]',null,'اگر کسی که بیمار یا مجروح است راحت باشد، درد زیادی ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['chair/bed/sofa etc Is that chair comfortable?','bedroom/lounge etc The bedroom was large and comfortable with a view of the river.','home/hotel/apartment etc This is a friendly and comfortable hotel.','comfortable clothes/shoes/boots etc You’ll need comfortable shoes for walking around the city.','a comfortable position When driving, make sure you are seated in a comfortable position.','comfortable surroundings (= comfortable things around you ) Relax in the comfortable surroundings of the hotel.','comfortable to wear/use/ride etc My bike isn’t very comfortable to ride.','warm and comfortable The house is warm and comfortable even in winter.','feel comfortable You’ll probably feel most comfortable wearing cotton clothes.','look comfortable That sofa looks wonderfully comfortable.','make something comfortable There are lots of ways you can make your home more comfortable to live in.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('1129c02d-29df-5c05-9451-59886329765f','8b7adfa0-b282-5c0c-a990-f4e95ecd5da3',1,'exchange information','تبادل اطلاعات','spoken & written','to exchange information or conversation with other people, using words, signs , writing etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'ارتباط برقرار کردن، پیام رساندن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"We communicated mostly by e-mail.","translation":"ما بیشتر از طریق ایمیل در ارتباط بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096152.mp3"},{"sentence":"People use more than words when they communicate with each other.","translation":"افراد هنگام ارتباط با یکدیگر بیشتر از کلمات استفاده می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669184.mp3"},{"sentence":"The decision was communicated to our staff late in 1998.","translation":"این تصمیم اواخر سال 1998 به کارکنان ما ابلاغ شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669187.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('84e4e311-96de-58e9-9f02-89853194477f','8b7adfa0-b282-5c0c-a990-f4e95ecd5da3',2,'tell people something','به مردم چیزی بگو','spoken & written','to express your thoughts and feelings clearly, so that other people understand them','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'افکار و احساسات خود را به وضوح بیان کنید تا دیگران آنها را درک کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A baby communicates its needs by crying.","translation":"نوزاد نیازهای خود را با گریه بیان می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096140.mp3"},{"sentence":"Without meaning to, she communicated her anxiety to her child.","translation":"او بدون اینکه منظوری داشته باشد، اضطراب خود را به فرزندش منتقل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096143.mp3"},{"sentence":"His enthusiasm communicated itself to the voters.","translation":"شور و شوق او خود را به رای دهندگان منتقل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669191.mp3"},{"sentence":"A teacher must be able to communicate effectively to students.","translation":"معلم باید بتواند به طور موثر با دانش آموزان ارتباط برقرار کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669195.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('2cac8be1-dff9-5c85-88ed-847e995b21c3','8b7adfa0-b282-5c0c-a990-f4e95ecd5da3',3,'understand','درک کنند','spoken & written','if two people communicate, they are able to talk about and understand each other’s feelings or desires','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر دو نفر با هم ارتباط برقرار کنند، می توانند درباره احساسات یا خواسته های یکدیگر صحبت کنند و درک کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many couples make themselves miserable by not communicating.","translation":"بسیاری از زوج ها با عدم برقراری ارتباط خود را بدبخت می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669200.mp3"},{"sentence":"Parents sometimes find it difficult to communicate with their teenage children.","translation":"والدین گاهی اوقات برای برقراری ارتباط با فرزندان نوجوان خود مشکل دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001096168.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('52d1dc29-ecdd-591c-a34d-5fd2d36e1690','8b7adfa0-b282-5c0c-a990-f4e95ecd5da3',4,'disease','بیماری','spoken & written','to pass a disease from one person or animal to another','[ transitive ]',null,'انتقال بیماری از یک شخص یا حیوان به دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('57ca1c7f-1964-5c1b-b6ec-35724ae662c9','8b7adfa0-b282-5c0c-a990-f4e95ecd5da3',5,'rooms','اتاق ها','spoken & written','if rooms or parts of a building communicate, you can get directly to one from the other','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر اتاق‌ها یا بخش‌هایی از ساختمان با هم ارتباط برقرار کنند، می‌توانید مستقیماً به یکی از دیگری بروید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"communicating doors","translation":"درهای ارتباطی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001669203.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3c7d1dd2-5a58-550d-8699-df0b1b930bb9','61175251-f08f-55fa-8623-95c43b48be88',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a situation in which people or organizations try to be more successful than other people or organizations','[ uncountable ]',null,'رقابت؛ مسابقه؛ رقبا (بازار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['face competition (from somebody) Website designers face increasing competition.','beat off/fight off competition She beat off competition from dozens of other candidates to get the job.','strong/serious competition The company is facing strong competition in the market.','stiff//tough/fierce/intense/keen competition (= strong competition ) There is stiff competition for places at the best universities.','cut-throat competition (= very strong competition ) The cutthroat competition in the airline industry kept prices low for many years.','increasing/growing competition the growing competition between banks','fair competition Fair competition offers the best guarantee of good services and low prices.','unfair competition This will protect the industry from unfair competition from abroad.','open competition (= a situation that offers anyone a chance to be successful ) We welcome open competition in the software market.','in the face of competition (= in a situation where you are competing to be successful ) They won the contract in the face of tough competition.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Competition for the job was intense.","translation":"رقابت برای این کار شدید بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875123.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sometimes there’s a lot of competition between children for their mother’s attention.","translation":"گاهی اوقات رقابت زیادی بین بچه ها برای جلب توجه مادرشان وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875120.mp3"},{"sentence":"This price reduction is due to competition among suppliers.","translation":"این کاهش قیمت به دلیل رقابت بین تامین کنندگان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875126.mp3"},{"sentence":"competition in the automobile industry","translation":"رقابت در صنعت خودرو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691092.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is fierce competition between the three leading soap manufacturers.","translation":"رقابت شدیدی بین سه تولید کننده صابون پیشرو وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875132.mp3"},{"sentence":"Government departments are in direct competition with each other for limited resources.","translation":"ادارات دولتی در رقابت مستقیم با یکدیگر برای منابع محدود هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691095.mp3"},{"sentence":"Small grocery stores are going out of business in the face of stiff competition from the large supermarket chains.","translation":"خواربارفروشی‌های کوچک در مواجهه با رقابت شدید سوپرمارکت‌های زنجیره‌ای بزرگ در حال از بین رفتن هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875136.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('a1052ab9-f01c-5473-9046-c1bcc3d99f12','61175251-f08f-55fa-8623-95c43b48be88',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the people or groups that are competing against you, especially in business or in a sport','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'افراد یا گروه هایی که با شما رقابت می کنند، به ویژه در تجارت یا ورزش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Going to trade fairs is an ideal opportunity to size up the competition .","translation":"رفتن به نمایشگاه ها فرصتی ایده آل برای افزایش رقابت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875143.mp3"},{"sentence":"Jones is certain to win the race; there’s just no competition.","translation":"جونز مطمئناً برنده مسابقه خواهد بود. فقط هیچ رقابتی وجود ندارد","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875147.mp3"},{"sentence":"The team overcame fierce competition for their place in the finals.","translation":"این تیم برای رسیدن به فینال رقابت سختی را پشت سر گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875151.mp3"},{"sentence":"Japanese PC makers now face foreign competition in their home market.","translation":"سازندگان رایانه های شخصی ژاپنی اکنون در بازار داخلی خود با رقابت خارجی روبرو هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691096.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('9bbe15e4-d4f9-5502-947c-ed90abcf61cd','61175251-f08f-55fa-8623-95c43b48be88',3,null,null,'spoken & written','an organized event in which people or teams compete against each other','[ countable ]',null,'یک رویداد سازمان یافته که در آن افراد یا تیم ها با یکدیگر رقابت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a photography competition","translation":"یک مسابقه عکاسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875160.mp3"},{"sentence":"a competition to find a designer for the new building","translation":"مسابقه ای برای یافتن طراح برای ساختمان جدید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875163.mp3"},{"sentence":"Teams from high schools all over the state have entered the competition.","translation":"تیم هایی از دبیرستان های سراسر ایالت در این مسابقه شرکت کرده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875169.mp3"},{"sentence":"With France out of the competition, England have a great chance to win.","translation":"با حذف فرانسه از رقابت ها، انگلیس شانس زیادی برای قهرمانی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001845219.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('95ddb44e-9147-5183-bfea-17ab89d04d20','755012f4-b30c-59fd-96cd-7ed85f908cc8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','determined or trying very hard to be more successful than other people or businesses',null,null,'رقابتی، پرتلاش برای برتری؛ سطح رقابتی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Some US industries are not as competitive as they have been in the past.","translation":"برخی از صنایع ایالات متحده به اندازه گذشته رقابتی نیستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691116.mp3"},{"sentence":"The team seems to have lost its competitive edge recently (= its ability to compete well ) .","translation":"به نظر می رسد این تیم اخیراً مزیت رقابتی خود را از دست داده است (= توانایی خود برای رقابت خوب).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001691120.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('206e4df1-d16d-516b-9215-2efeac18b365','755012f4-b30c-59fd-96cd-7ed85f908cc8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to competition',null,null,'مربوط به رقابت','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Competitive sports encourage children to work together as a team.","translation":"ورزش های رقابتی کودکان را تشویق می کند تا به صورت تیمی با هم کار کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875181.mp3"},{"sentence":"Advertising is an intensely competitive business.","translation":"تبلیغات یک تجارت به شدت رقابتی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875184.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('fa81da05-0bfb-587c-b013-67d73142e505','755012f4-b30c-59fd-96cd-7ed85f908cc8',3,null,null,'spoken & written','products or prices that are competitive are cheaper than others but still of good quality',null,null,'محصولات یا قیمت هایی که رقابتی هستند ارزان تر از سایرین هستند اما همچنان با کیفیت هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The hotel offers a high standard of service at competitive rates.","translation":"این هتل خدمات استاندارد بالایی را با نرخ های رقابتی ارائه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000875188.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c81d4804-1227-527e-9fb6-10fc482efdfc','a8452a81-5a49-59f2-8833-2d308b906a9c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','difficult to understand or deal with, because many parts or details are involved',null,null,'پیچیده، دشوار (فهم)',array['complex']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a complicated voting system","translation":"یک سیستم رای گیری پیچیده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876356.mp3"},{"sentence":"For young children, getting dressed is a complicated business.","translation":"برای کودکان خردسال، لباس پوشیدن یک تجارت پیچیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876357.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mental illness is a very complicated subject.","translation":"بیماری روانی موضوع بسیار پیچیده ای است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876360.mp3"},{"sentence":"The problem is very complex .","translation":"مشکل بسیار پیچیده است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('385d8c92-dd26-551d-810a-0bef84ecd5aa','a8452a81-5a49-59f2-8833-2d308b906a9c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','consisting of many closely connected parts',null,null,'متشکل از بسیاری از بخش های نزدیک به هم',array['complex']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a complicated pattern","translation":"یک الگوی پیچیده","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001697063.mp3"},{"sentence":"The human brain is an incredibly complicated organ.","translation":"مغز انسان عضوی فوق العاده پیچیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000876364.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('e71b7f8a-ccb1-5c26-8bb5-f162530205ab','069836d1-1d91-536a-ab4a-1bec116d2768',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to think very carefully about something that you are doing','[ intransitive ]',null,'تمرکز کردن (ذهن)؛ تغلیظ (مایع)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Now please concentrate.","translation":"حالا لطفا تمرکز کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687765.mp3"},{"sentence":"Adrian was finding it difficult to concentrate.","translation":"آدریان به سختی می‌توانست تمرکز کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000850700.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be quiet – let me concentrate on my homework.","translation":"ساکت باش - بگذار روی تکالیفم تمرکز کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687766.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m trying to concentrate on my work.","translation":"من سعی می کنم روی کارم تمرکز کنم.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,4),
('d5bd37be-4119-5b8d-880b-68a7573fabcc','069836d1-1d91-536a-ab4a-1bec116d2768',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to be present in large numbers or amounts somewhere, or to cause people or things to be present in large numbers or amounts somewhere','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'حضور در تعداد یا مقادیر زیاد در جایی، یا باعث می شود افراد یا چیزها به تعداد یا مقادیر زیاد در جایی حضور داشته باشند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Italian industry is concentrated mainly in the north.","translation":"صنعت ایتالیا عمدتاً در شمال متمرکز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000850708.mp3"},{"sentence":"Construction of the aircraft is being concentrated at Prestwick.","translation":"ساخت این هواپیما در Prestwick متمرکز شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001687770.mp3"},{"sentence":"Women concentrate in a small number of occupations.","translation":"زنان در تعداد کمی از مشاغل تمرکز می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000850709.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('0ead2195-eb88-5da1-bdd5-e97458d05051','069836d1-1d91-536a-ab4a-1bec116d2768',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'something concentrates the mind','تمرکز کردن (ذهن)؛ تغلیظ (مایع)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('36397bc3-24e2-5e33-b78b-a45369e74f28','069836d1-1d91-536a-ab4a-1bec116d2768',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a substance or liquid stronger by removing some of the water from it','[ transitive ]',null,'برای قوی تر کردن یک ماده یا مایع با حذف مقداری آب از آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('26e34471-4beb-59cb-984f-61620e7a1a3c','dc27873d-3be6-5fc2-b0cc-24dd00797ea3',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a substance or liquid which has been made stronger by removing most of the water from it',null,null,'ماده یا مایعی که با حذف بیشتر آب از آن قوی تر شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"orange juice concentrate","translation":"کنسانتره آب پرتقال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000850743.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7c02a90b-0a47-548e-b876-385be3f90c85','f5f10ea4-cbc4-52a1-b344-1c2d3922d585',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that happens as a result of a particular action or set of conditions','[ countable ]',null,'نتیجه، پیامد؛ پیامد (ناخواسته)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be a consequence of something Low energy may be a consequence of sleeping badly.','have consequences Taking financial risks can have serious consequences.','accept/take the consequences (= understand and deal with them ) I’m prepared to accept the consequences of my decision.','face/suffer the consequences (= accept the bad results of something you have done ) He broke the law, and he will have to face the consequences.','consequences follow (= happen ) Once the decision has been made, consequences follow.','consider the consequences (= think what might happen as a result of something ) She jumped into the river without considering the consequences.','escape the consequences (= avoid them ) I knew I’d made a mistake and that I couldn’t escape the consequences.','the possible/likely consequences What are the likely consequences of these changes?','an inevitable consequence (= that you cannot avoid ) Loss of mobility is not an inevitable consequence of old age.','serious consequences (= bad and important ) Too much fishing in these seas has had serious consequences.','disastrous/dire consequences (= very bad and damaging ) If temperatures continue to rise, it could have disastrous consequences for agriculture.','an important consequence This discovery was an important consequence of his research.','social/political/economic consequences The rise in food prices has had enormous economic and political consequences.','a direct consequence of something (= a consequence directly caused by something ) The spread of information has been a direct consequence of the Internet.','a natural/logical consequence (= that naturally/logically follows something ) Obviously disappointment is a natural consequence of defeat.','a negative consequence (= a bad or unpleasant result ) the negative consequences of drinking too much alcohol','an adverse/unfortunate consequence (= that affects your life, a situation etc badly ) Divorce often has unfortunate consequences for children.','tragic consequences (= very sad, usually involving death ) Someone dropped a burning cigarette, with tragic consequences.','far-reaching consequences (= important and affecting many things ) The new law is sure to have far-reaching consequences.','long-term consequences (= results that last a long time, or appear after a long time ) If you smoke it may have long-term consequences.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Many believe that poverty is a direct consequence of overpopulation.","translation":"بسیاری بر این باورند که فقر پیامد مستقیم افزایش جمعیت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675434.mp3"},{"sentence":"Our findings have far-reaching consequences for researchers.","translation":"یافته های ما پیامدهای گسترده ای برای محققان دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675437.mp3"},{"sentence":"He ate some poisonous mushrooms, with fatal consequences.","translation":"او مقداری قارچ سمی خورد که عواقب آن کشنده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001675448.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
